<!doctype lake><title>𝐓𝐨𝐤𝐞𝐧 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐞𝐫-𝐈</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="a5y85" id="a5y85" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue050ad92" id="ue050ad92">𝐆𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐃 𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐓𝐀 𝐍𝐄𝐓𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐊𝐒</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u0d88d68b" id="u0d88d68b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1113eaf4" id="u1113eaf4">线性 Transformer 使用基于核函数的点积线性注意力取代传统的 Softmax 注意力，并可将其重新表述为一种具有矩阵值隐状态的线性循环神经网络，从而显著降低推理阶段的内存需求。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u911d8b0d" id="u911d8b0d">尽管早期线性 Transformer 在语言建模任务上的表现通常逊于标准 Transformer，但近期研究通过引入类似 LSTM 的数据依赖门控机制，取得显著进展，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u14d739a2" id="u14d739a2" style="color: #663000">代表性模型包括 GLA 和 Mamba2</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue46b34cc" id="ue46b34cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3f69fc3" id="uc3f69fc3" style="color: #5C0036">如何在长序列中有效管理信息仍然是线性 Transformer 面临的重要挑战。尤其是在上下文内检索任务中，传统 Transformer 依然具有明显优势</span></strong></p><ul list="u2828aabe"><li fid="ud6440921" data-lake-id="u1d3685c2" id="u1d3685c2"><span data-lake-id="u16cde854" id="u16cde854">线性 Transformer 可以被解释为实现一种基于外积的键值关联记忆，其形式与张量积表征相似。然而，此类模型所能存储的相互正交键值对数量受到模型维度的限制。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucaa66eaa" id="ucaa66eaa" style="color: #2A4200">当序列长度超过该维度时，不同键值关联之间不可避免地会发生记忆碰撞</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaed53d76" id="uaed53d76">，从而阻碍模型对目标信息的精确检索</span></li><li fid="ud6440921" data-lake-id="u1a4010f9" id="u1a4010f9"><span data-lake-id="udb623c6e" id="udb623c6e">Mamba2 通过引入一种简单的门控更新规则来缓解这一局限，其状态更新形式为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_tS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc931ad2637ae2b04d8598a8d171fbb93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eQ2iV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud89f1fde" id="ud89f1fde">。在每个时间步，该规则利用动态衰减系数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb77064fbd2d8d47a6f1575f354c7f5c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C4knR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc9e641e" id="ubc9e641e">对所有键值关联进行统一衰减。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9063fbd" id="ud9063fbd">这种方法并未考虑不同键值关联之间的重要性差异，因此可能导致记忆资源利用效率不足。当模型需要遗忘某个特定的键值关联时，其他所有键值关联也会以相同程度被衰减，使得记忆清除过程缺乏针对性</span></strong></li><li fid="ud6440921" data-lake-id="ub2decb57" id="ub2decb57"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1e97c78f" id="u1e97c78f">DeltaNet 通过以序列化方式利用新到达的键值对对旧键值对进行软替换，从而实现对记忆内容的选择性更新。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8694f0a6" id="u8694f0a6">该方法在上下文内检索的合成基准测试中表现出色。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u364d9b01" id="u364d9b01" style="color: #004347">然而，由于其每次只能修改一个键值关联，模型缺乏快速清除过时信息或无关信息的能力。尤其是在上下文发生切换、需要擦除先前信息时，这一局限更为突出。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c5c4601" id="u1c5c4601">DeltaNet 在真实世界任务中的表现相对一般，这可能是由于其缺少一种有效且稳健的记忆清除机制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u08388bd7" id="u08388bd7"><span data-lake-id="u19263a0f" id="u19263a0f">鉴于门控更新规则和 Delta 规则在记忆管理方面具有互补优势，提出门控 Delta 规则，这是一种将二者统一起来的简单而直观的机制。该规则能够实现灵活的记忆控制：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6dffe168" id="u6dffe168" style="color: #DF2A3F">当令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Crightarrow0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67541fa1a2c8ec7c7d5fe377f6c20fec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ipd3x%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ube6fa55b" id="ube6fa55b" style="color: #DF2A3F">时，模型可以迅速清除已有记忆；当令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Crightarrow1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ae7f4fda5f48636daa265d98512bca7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wyoHy%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fe0139b" id="u8fe0139b" style="color: #DF2A3F">时，该机制实际上退化为纯 Delta 规则，使模型能够在不影响其他信息的情况下，对特定记忆内容进行选择性更新</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9eb40a82" id="u9eb40a82"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc24f0cff" id="uc24f0cff">剩余关键挑战在于如何以硬件高效的方式实现门控 Delta 规则。已有研究基于 WY 表示提出一种能够并行计算 Delta 规则的高效算法。在此基础上，对该方法进行扩展，将门控项纳入其计算过程。该扩展保留分块并行计算的优势，从而使门控 Delta 规则能够在现代硬件上实现高效训练</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="VW6xz" id="VW6xz" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufcd8c11c" id="ufcd8c11c">🐨</span><span data-lake-id="u60b0435c" id="u60b0435c"> 𝐌𝐀𝐌𝐁𝐀𝟐: 𝐋𝐈𝐍𝐄𝐀𝐑 𝐀𝐓𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇 𝐃𝐄𝐂𝐀𝐘</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub7c105a4" id="ub7c105a4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u26eabf26" id="u26eabf26">在不考虑归一化操作以及查询和键的激活函数时，线性 Transformer 可以表述为如下线性递推形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5542a520" id="u5542a520" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_t%3DS_tq_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F649823114e57bf60c8d1af5ab6befc25.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CAlUm%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u709e50c5"><li fid="u8cb84b13" data-lake-id="u962a5103" id="u962a5103"><span data-lake-id="u73f5ad81" id="u73f5ad81">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dbcade63c0d54d42df63c3aa277d4b1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ticnV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb06ab21" id="udb06ab21">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8fad9f83d941e63c66097ab93e11d76b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BNmnY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u982e5585" id="u982e5585">分别表示查询/键和值的注意力头维度。通过展开上述递推关系，分别得到向量形式和矩阵形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7f10f250" id="u7f10f250" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D(v_ik_i%5E%5C%5Ctop)q_t%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7Dv_i(k_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O%3D(QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%20M)V%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f81c86a2d2589526686355c6688a4a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rgwxA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf64447f"><li fid="u52134834" data-lake-id="u46096dfe" id="u46096dfe"><span data-lake-id="ud732e94a" id="ud732e94a">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q7DPE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9212fe02" id="u9212fe02">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20L%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c3c5c4ff7fa4d4988895b48978c5981.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22evXP8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37f458aa" id="u37f458aa">为因果掩码：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%3Cj%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F643ad1f2b1f19ca5e1429afb5d2f1276.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PGaie%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee701322" id="uee701322">时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bij%7D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe5a2e81d472e27f8520c342289e98eb3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WD87O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7553b9da" id="u7553b9da">；否则</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bij%7D%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F230641c914998495ece021ded3354632.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0q8V%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd6cc7ba" id="udd6cc7ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11a28328" id="u11a28328">基础的线性注意力在语言建模任务上的性能远逊于标准 Transformer。为解决这一问题，一种常见做法是引入衰减项，以遗忘历史信息。以 Mamba2 为例，其可以表示为如下线性递推形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub5cc97cc" id="ub5cc97cc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_tS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_t%3DS_tq_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F424fdd5d13c17a3303d44ea1ec9be419.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rIDa0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u72c0568b"><li fid="ubce08d07" data-lake-id="u1957f70f" id="u1957f70f"><span data-lake-id="u10a15f70" id="u10a15f70">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb77064fbd2d8d47a6f1575f354c7f5c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BmGol%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub6ed6b20" id="ub6ed6b20">是一个随时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vxigx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6495ce0" id="ue6495ce0">变化、依赖于输入数据的标量衰减项。定义累积衰减乘积</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_j%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Calpha_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb5677f8e3f5f31949efe54c543736d7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lrLxU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0bde959" id="uc0bde959">。通过展开上述递推关系，可以分别得到如下向量形式和矩阵并行形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u218279ec" id="u218279ec" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7Dv_ik_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7Dv_i%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7Dk_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O%3D%5C%5Cbigl((QK%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cbigr)V.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7c2a47158e8c7dd8490ddff7457c719.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jbTec%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u18df2c27" id="u18df2c27" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7D%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_j%7D%2C%20%26%20i%5C%5Cge%20j%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20i%3Cj%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a6e3b6004f40da3c4f2b828d76fe680.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rZqKo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf2fc8ef"><li fid="u92ff4eda" data-lake-id="u2c6aacad" id="u2c6aacad"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20L%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae1e5b5e6beb6183537ad6eadea6295f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iXoRT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua737fe88" id="ua737fe88">是一个考虑衰减效应的因果掩码。上述并行形式与递推形式之间的等价关系也被称为状态空间对偶性</span></li><li fid="u92ff4eda" data-lake-id="u949b179a" id="u949b179a"><span data-lake-id="u34f22735" id="u34f22735">类似的递推结构还出现在 Gated RFA、xLSTM 和 Gated RetNet 等多种架构中。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F704fcfbbad39db9380725f14549b4ac1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DP9Vu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6648210d" id="u6648210d">与输入数据无关时，该形式可退化为 RetNet 和 Lightning Attention</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubd5e33c0" id="ubd5e33c0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u59f77663" id="u59f77663">为实现硬件友好的线性时间训练，通常采用分块并行形式。分块并行方法将输入和输出划分为若干大小为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xt6fi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb5b073e" id="ufb5b073e">的分块，并依据前一个分块的最终状态以及当前分块的查询、键和值矩阵计算当前分块的输出</span></strong></p><ul list="u381ac973"><li fid="u08eab689" data-lake-id="u4f485892" id="u4f485892"><span data-lake-id="u7e9f0f24" id="u7e9f0f24">定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3A%3Dq_%7BtC%2B1%3A(t%2B1)C%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4189920687ad2d5b36804662d93efc2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mo4eW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf2e741b9" id="uf2e741b9">为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XZNdi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae87cb3a" id="uae87cb3a">个分块的查询矩阵，并定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3A%3Dq_%7BtC%2Br%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3595236e969de85c25e323b452c1c79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vZBdS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e62c25b" id="u4e62c25b">为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffDXD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a072b31" id="u4a072b31">个分块内的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AKFys%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u630a7066" id="u630a7066">个查询向量。第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fa5yB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefc7f752" id="uefc7f752">个分块的初始状态定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3A%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E0%3DS_%7B%5Bt-1%5D%7D%5EC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fadc113710ca395d4f0d8aabbbab30554.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z0PsF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58c3ccba" id="u58c3ccba">。通过对递推关系进行部分展开，可以得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u84a3b342" id="u84a3b342" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dv_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Erq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7Dq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dv_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faac8d3bb9639fdb1aa90759bb851a8cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tw5sl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u90bbb8ae" id="u90bbb8ae" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2BV_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3DQ_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%5C%5Cbigl(Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DK_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%20M%5C%5Cbigr)V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F304c44ec704bf3d0681120220884ea46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NbqIe%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uacadccba"><li fid="uac0e94af" data-lake-id="u6f44caac" id="u6f44caac"><span data-lake-id="ue12910c1" id="ue12910c1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67d74f731f1423bb77d548c1a4120b0a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MPEwx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e60046b" id="u5e60046b">是分块内部的因果掩码。上述方程主要由矩阵乘法运算构成，因此可以充分利用张量核心进行硬件层面的优化。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc74186c5" id="uc74186c5">这种分块算法也可以方便地扩展至包含衰减项的线性注意力</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2062f592" id="u2062f592" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2BV_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%5C%5Cbigl(Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DK_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cbigr)V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c0b91560a38e8f292513ee712e42081.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rESbD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5419c0b2" id="u5419c0b2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bij%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3DtC%2B1%7D%5E%7BtC%2Bj%7D%20%5C%5Calpha_j.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8804173d7dfbc2989031664d96b82cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uvJ3c%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44134b75"><li fid="ue7f1bbf6" data-lake-id="u3e56bf6b" id="u3e56bf6b"><span data-lake-id="u267980ce" id="u267980ce">使用左箭头</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B(%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5C%2C)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5b75e76fe2476fa3a2430b103b2408e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MvToN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52ec6d82" id="u52ec6d82">和右箭头</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B(%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5C%2C)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcbd7e752ca5728f33e40a9f739571fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JmjgA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u188f5158" id="u188f5158">，分别表示将变量衰减至每个分块的首位置和末位置</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4c10faf0" id="u4c10faf0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20each%20vector%20to%20the%20first%20position%20of%20chunk%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20each%20vector%20to%20the%20last%20position%20of%20chunk%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20the%20state%20matrix%20over%20the%20entire%20chunk%20%7D%20t%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F391f20ecf291274057577e18b5824023.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jfNk5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5f2795a8" id="u5f2795a8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6d5dc37" id="uc6d5dc37">首先将线性注意力及其带衰减形式表示为等价的递推与并行矩阵计算，并进一步通过 chunkwise 将逐 token 串行更新改写为块内少量大规模 GEMM、块间仅传递紧凑状态矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61cdb7951046f809c7f88849351d8c3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tT28c%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0df27798" id="u0df27798">，从而在保持线性复杂度和计算等价性的同时充分利用 GPU Tensor Core</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="Yt4FX" id="Yt4FX" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u45b552f4" id="u45b552f4">🦌</span><span data-lake-id="u599f93ed" id="u599f93ed"> 𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐓𝐀 𝐍𝐄𝐓𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐊𝐒: 𝐋𝐈𝐍𝐄𝐀𝐑 𝐀𝐓𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇 𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐓𝐀 𝐑𝐔𝐋𝐄</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub54459b9" id="ub54459b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="udf0c83e2" id="udf0c83e2">Delta 更新规则会动态擦除与当前输入键</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78892696c6e1bf5f58b9dcb2afe4b243.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W047L%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2c18ac4f" id="u2c18ac4f">相关联的旧值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29725a4cb5387ec835290c4dd01eb768.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L3Hrv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud637a4dd" id="ud637a4dd">，写入新值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95380b2fcd18a90013477abf9e3fcefe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bA2tV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c086588" id="u8c086588">。新值由当前输入值与旧值根据写入强</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc84f1e35fd4d7410415bf60b49b2e1bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HLE2Y%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5394378e" id="u5394378e">进行线性组合得到</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3d7c1106" id="u3d7c1106" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%20S_t%20%26%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B(S_%7Bt-1%7Dk_t)%7D_%7Bv_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7Dk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta_t%20v_t%2B(1-%5C%5Cbeta_t)S_%7Bt-1%7Dk_t%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7Bv_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnew%7D%7D%7Dk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%26%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Cbeta_tv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20.%20%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36374bff3243153713f6aa44ac092baf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JLwt5%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u557b0fca"><li fid="ue9db157d" data-lake-id="u84bcba03" id="u84bcba03"><strong><span data-lake-id="u21d978d8" id="u21d978d8" style="color: #2A4200">DeltaNet 实现一种以广义 Householder 矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69c5c70125197fecd929e4f901d58824.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tUL2J%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8f61e5c" id="ua8f61e5c" style="color: #2A4200">为状态转移矩阵的一阶线性递推。尽管 DeltaNet 在关联回忆和语言建模任务中表现出色，但由于计算效率较低，其长期以来并未受到广泛关注</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u63dc6531" id="u63dc6531"><strong><span data-lake-id="u81e7c0e3" id="u81e7c0e3">Chunkwise parallel form：分块并行与 WY 表示法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ued6509dd" id="ued6509dd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05ed5442a3a9e930bda52150b0c4302d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ANuyP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue125c909"><li fid="u57e589c7" data-lake-id="u62f30528" id="u62f30528"><span data-lake-id="uaeaa646c" id="uaeaa646c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97095ad1ee17e2e55dd6870ecfd7422d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UA0Y6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2482cc0" id="ub2482cc0">涉及广义 Householder 矩阵的累积乘积，这可以通过经典的 WY 表示法进行优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce3bd051" id="uce3bd051" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ce779b59477b024aa91fc6ba8a51beb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KWnW8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u97e395d4" id="u97e395d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ea9a433f3dbdff23993aff12107839a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JYdEs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5d69047a"><li fid="uba2e6b6b" data-lake-id="u925dcd65" id="u925dcd65"><span data-lake-id="u56689e1a" id="u56689e1a">UT transform 让 W、U 一次性用矩阵运算算出来</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf9f86df9" id="uf9f86df9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F492570b0698dbd27a1e5abac72324ec5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vx2QG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud25be315" id="ud25be315" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Ctext%7BstrictLower%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D%20(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe6339788c832a3eaced5e4b6752fc321.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Igcw0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2071a4d8"><li fid="u9bcc0813" data-lake-id="uc14678c6" id="uc14678c6"><span data-lake-id="u41333b6a" id="u41333b6a">硬件高效的 DeltaNet 分块算法，该算法利用矩阵乘法，从而实现基于张量核心的 GPU 优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u285634e5" id="u285634e5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%26%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%26%26%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd84389c1e77e818a10c7c291e5f2da1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cQhmF%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="EWHxO" id="EWHxO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8d6ece3f" id="u8d6ece3f">🦊</span><span data-lake-id="u853cc558" id="u853cc558"> 𝐆𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐃 𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐓𝐀 𝐍𝐄𝐓𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐊𝐒</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf32d5341" id="uf32d5341"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5028682d" id="u5028682d">所提出的门控 Delta 规则简单而有效</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9b0c8d02" id="u9b0c8d02" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Cbeta_tv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a1c81bc3ba3efe7e1f40ad7f87b57fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xljXy%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8fae3737"><li fid="u268521b0" data-lake-id="u4ab64dfb" id="u4ab64dfb"><span data-lake-id="u4d031a56" id="u4d031a56">其中依赖于输入数据的门控项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb77064fbd2d8d47a6f1575f354c7f5c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mDM2b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09ffe53f" id="u09ffe53f">用于控制状态衰减。该形式统一门控机制与 Delta 规则各自的优势：门控项能够实现自适应记忆管理，而 Delta 更新结构则有助于有效学习键值关联</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u85cc742b" id="u85cc742b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6f3047e" id="uc6f3047e">循环状态更新可以被解释为某个在线学习问题的闭式解。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u03bd847c" id="u03bd847c">近期的线性 RNN 架构通常会在在线学习目标中引入正则化项，以防止当前状态相对于先前状态发生过大偏移，从而实现信息保留。然而，当状态中积累的信息趋于饱和时，这种保留机制会带来问题。在这种情况下，每个状态都会编码多个信息片段的叠加表示，从而增加精确检索的难度</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf8a4f234" id="uf8a4f234" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1784340110372-484d2d38-3cd1-4ebb-ad24-928dd5d0d86d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucf47c62b-56ff-4ca7-8f3a-41e702b009d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u410d8076-5915-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A809.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A188%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A74822%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1458%2C%22originHeight%22%3A338%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DDELANERST-AS-IL%25-2(SKT%2C8%3A(OT-A%3AST-IKI)SR%3DS-1AL-BKK)T%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A1178%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-ATST-1%7C%E7%A4%BA-2(STKT%2CUT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A192%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A394%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TST-ST-I%E5%88%86-2(STKT%2CBT(UT-ST-1KT))%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A672%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-ST-1%E7%AC%AC-BISIKT-UT2%22%2C%22x%22%3A188%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A421%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-ST-1%E7%A4%BA-2(SIKT%2C0T)%22%2C%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A365%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3DATST-1%E5%8D%81UTKI%22%2C%22x%22%3A801%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3DST-1(I-EKTKT)%E5%8D%81ETUTKI%2CET%22%2C%22x%22%3A806%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A455%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3DST-1%E5%8D%81UKT%22%2C%22x%22%3A801%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A252%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-IKT))ST%3DST-I(I-BIKTK)%E5%8D%81BIUKT%22%2C%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A648%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONLINELEARNINGOBJECTIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A291%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONLINEUPDATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A803%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3FT1%2BKFKT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1208%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A246%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAMBA2%22%2C%22x%22%3A5%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LONGHORN%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DELTANET%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLETHO%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LA%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cEjB9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8c336793" id="u8c336793"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf3085eb" id="ucf3085eb">为解决这一局限，Mamba2 和 Gated DeltaNet 引入自适应缩放因子</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SYEDS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u85165132" id="u85165132">，以放松正则化项对状态更新的约束，使</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20S_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e16559339cf76b0f378096f0f82c15a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZuH9r%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0aae21aa" id="u0aae21aa">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1ba8fe9af228584bc2162bb340bd778.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dFKKa%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub118a7d6" id="ub118a7d6">之间能够发生受控偏移。通过选择性遗忘，该机制实现动态记忆管理，并可用于滤除无关信息</span></strong></p><ul list="u7ac04cdf"><li fid="uc7682e8f" data-lake-id="u5caa8fca" id="u5caa8fca"><span data-lake-id="ub29fd839" id="ub29fd839">线性注意力和 Mamba2 使用简单的负内积损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Clangle%20S_tk_t%2Cv_t%5C%5Crangle%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8badba63774c9b825d4a2411478b3a7d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KQr6u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad8ea7fc" id="uad8ea7fc">，而 Longhorn 则采用表达能力更强的在线回归目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5ClVert%20S_tk_t-v_t%5C%5CrVert%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1831da11a998ac6643a04fac29960da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IT3oP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb93d705" id="ubb93d705">，以更有效地建模键值关联。由此得到的 Longhorn 更新规则与 Delta 更新规则高度相似，这表明在上下文内关联回忆任务中，门控 Delta 规则可能优于 Mamba2</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u23db5c60" id="u23db5c60"><span data-lake-id="uf57e2621" id="uf57e2621">从快速权重编程、测试时训练和测试时回归的角度来看，隐状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bc506%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d6329d6" id="u7d6329d6">可以被解释为一个（快速）权重矩阵，而 Delta 规则则通过测试时随机梯度下降优化在线回归目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L(S_t)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5ClVert%20S_tk_t-v_t%5C%5CrVert%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F668549e1b490f0ad70fdc9ef378f702a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OxplW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua02418ac" id="ua02418ac" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7Bt%2B1%7D%3DS_t-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cnabla%20L(S_t)%3DS_t-%5C%5Cbeta_t(S_tk_t-v_t)k_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%3DS_t%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Cbeta_tv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb65aedf6318ce623bf6323c755ff989c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wqMVF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3ac35a1e"><li fid="u4818f296" data-lake-id="ud25bfd77" id="ud25bfd77"><span data-lake-id="u95ee4ff0" id="u95ee4ff0">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qKezY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue72ea28a" id="ue72ea28a">表示自适应学习率。门控 Delta 规则可以被理解为在 SGD 更新中引入自适应权重衰减项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wQoln%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u347bf2e3" id="u347bf2e3">，而权重衰减是深度学习中被广泛采用的一项技术。与此同时，Titans 的研究也表明，在 RNN 的测试时 SGD 更新中引入权重衰减机制能够取得良好效果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2a0ed10e" id="u2a0ed10e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95b9eff1" id="u95b9eff1" style="color: #00346B">门控负责过滤和清除无关记忆，Delta 规则负责稳定保留并精确写入关键信息，二者结合能够兼顾长程记忆、记忆管理与复杂模式记忆</span></strong></p><ul list="ua84c30fc"><li fid="ud89def79" data-lake-id="uedaa093e" id="uedaa093e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a8dc7ef" id="u3a8dc7ef">S-NIAH-1：衰减不利于长期记忆保持。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u85fe1d70" id="u85fe1d70"> 在重复合成上下文中，模型只需长期保存少量关键信息。DeltaNet 在不同序列长度下均接近满分；Mamba2 因持续衰减历史状态，在序列长度超过 2K 后性能明显下降；Gated DeltaNet 借助 Delta 规则增强记忆保持能力，因此退化幅度较小</span></li><li fid="ud89def79" data-lake-id="u4b18f95a" id="u4b18f95a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72f0fbaa" id="u72f0fbaa">S-NIAH-2/3：门控机制有助于过滤无关信息。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd96c44e" id="ucd96c44e"> 在真实文章上下文中，模型需要暂存大量潜在相关信息。由于状态容量固定，若缺乏有效的记忆清除机制，信息会不断叠加并产生记忆碰撞。DeltaNet 在长序列上的性能显著下降，而 Mamba2 和 Gated DeltaNet 可通过门控机制选择性遗忘无关内容，因此表现更加稳定</span></li><li fid="ud89def79" data-lake-id="ud1fcd7fe" id="ud1fcd7fe"><strong><span data-lake-id="u30a3d6d7" id="u30a3d6d7">S-NIAH-3：Delta 规则有助于复杂模式记忆。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6a976858" id="u6a976858"> 当待记忆的值由简单数字替换为 UUID 后，任务对精确写入和复杂模式记忆提出更高要求。Mamba2 的性能迅速下降，而 Gated DeltaNet 表现更好，说明 Delta 规则具有更强的键值关联学习与精确记忆能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u72ddaab3" id="u72ddaab3"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc123b92c" id="uc123b92c" style="color: #70000D">把 gated delta rule 的逐 token 递推改写成按 chunk 并行的训练算法，让主要计算变成大矩阵乘法 + 少量三角求解，从而吃满 GPU tensor core</span></strong></p><ul list="u70849149"><li fid="u8bf37b36" data-lake-id="u83793a92" id="u83793a92"><span data-lake-id="uf7b2e359" id="uf7b2e359">Chunk 内部分展开：把逐 token 递推改写成块内两项分解</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u286558e7" id="u286558e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BF%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5Er%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F33b01d27c5fc99b5f43fe238fd4d394c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ArhoE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u16fdbd19"><li fid="u66b04127" data-lake-id="u029047f6" id="u029047f6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e246f8ccbf824a618da2354c28ca882.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LLOv5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c96291d" id="u1c96291d">的低秩展开：把写入累积写成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum%20u_i%20k_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2ff59dcb32a6c8b2d0ff9e6deca097a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WwSEB%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udee8049e" id="udee8049e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BF%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa115b2af8aeee53d88e015a05117493.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22biGlJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uce507b7b" id="uce507b7b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%7D%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13a48485b8aaa910e1af55bc57b84270.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gKMdC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud5eaf3f9"><li fid="u1f722328" data-lake-id="u74e8d9f6" id="u74e8d9f6"><span data-lake-id="uc56e07cf" id="uc56e07cf">UT transform：把递推升级成块级矩阵一次算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u70d10411" id="u70d10411" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Ctext%7BstrictLower%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d9edb108203198a574f5175681c9718.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jsFjs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u04994d7c"><li fid="u02ff0739" data-lake-id="ud7011a7a" id="ud7011a7a"><span data-lake-id="u6b85c93c" id="u6b85c93c">最终状态更新式：只用块末状态 + 当前块的矩阵运算得到下一块状态</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4012eab1" id="u4012eab1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%26%26%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%20(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%26%26%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde67e94bf1063175d1df5bac26f23445.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pc9Nl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc2fafff2" id="uc2fafff2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%