height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23414237%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uadcbd362%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="hzFCL" id="hzFCL" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3a7d2a44" id="u3a7d2a44">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="u19af82fd" id="u19af82fd"> 𝐊𝐢𝐦𝐢 𝐋𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐫: 𝐀𝐧 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞, 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ub6551c81" id="ub6551c81"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f3edad5" id="u6f3edad5">随着大语言模型逐步演化为能力日益强大的智能体，其推理阶段的计算需求——尤其是在长时程任务与强化学习场景下，正日益成为核心瓶颈</span></strong></p><ul list="ufdbdd49f"><li fid="ue17c9c27" data-lake-id="u84aaa3db" id="u84aaa3db"><span data-lake-id="u23fcf406" id="u23fcf406">随着研究范式转向 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u37f137ce" id="u37f137ce">RL 测试时扩展</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u37dfc3e5" id="u37dfc3e5">，模型需要在推理过程中处理更长的交互轨迹、工具调用过程以及复杂的决策空间，这进一步暴露标准注意力机制在效率方面的根本性局限</span></li><li fid="ue17c9c27" data-lake-id="u670b6788" id="u670b6788"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc29b48d9" id="uc29b48d9" style="color: #664900">Softmax 注意力具有二次时间复杂度，同时其键值缓存会随序列长度线性增长，由此带来显著的计算与内存开销，限制系统吞吐率、上下文长度扩展能力以及实时交互性能</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua741b409" id="ua741b409"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4397bc57" id="u4397bc57">线性注意力降低注意力计算复杂度提供一种具有理论依据的方法。然而，由于表达能力有限，传统线性注意力在语言建模任务上的表现长期逊于 Softmax 注意力，甚至在较短序列上也是如此</span></strong></p><ul list="u6c321cad"><li fid="u3836616b" data-lake-id="u9035cff7" id="u9035cff7"><span data-lake-id="udcf4138c" id="udcf4138c">近年来，两类关键技术进展显著缩小二者之间的性能差距：一类是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u24d39361" id="u24d39361">门控或衰减机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8369d6f7" id="u8369d6f7">，另一类是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uda9bbcc8" id="uda9bbcc8">Delta Rule（增量规则）</span></strong></li><li fid="u3836616b" data-lake-id="u983e4455" id="u983e4455"><span data-lake-id="u334e42b5" id="u334e42b5">纯线性结构仍然受到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3eb435ee" id="u3eb435ee">有限状态容量这一根本约束，因此在长序列建模以及上下文内信息检索方面存在理论上的困难。近年来逐渐出现一类混合架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3452d7d" id="ue3452d7d">：在大部分层中采用计算效率更高的线性注意力，同时周期性地插入少量具有全局建模能力的 Softmax 注意力层，以在模型质量与计算效率之间取得折中</span></li><li fid="u3836616b" data-lake-id="ued88474e" id="ued88474e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a2e2990" id="u6a2e2990" style="color: #2A4200">然而，已有混合模型往往仅在有限规模下进行验证，或者缺少覆盖多种任务与基准的系统性评估。因而，其核心挑战仍然在于：如何设计一种注意力架构，使其在模型质量上达到甚至超过全注意力，同时在速度和内存开销方面获得显著收益</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u23ca2664" id="u23ca2664"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b85d704" id="u2b85d704" style="color: #AD1A2B">Kimi Linear，一种面向智能体智能与测试时扩展需求设计的混合线性注意力架构，其目标是在显著提升推理效率的同时不牺牲模型质量</span></strong></p><ul list="u983e6c30"><li fid="u149727d4" data-lake-id="u6ed525d5" id="u6ed525d5"><span data-lake-id="u21544f55" id="u21544f55">Kimi Linear 的核心模块是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8453b9c4" id="u8453b9c4">Kimi Delta Attention（KDA）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc797740f" id="uc797740f">，这是一种具有硬件高效特性的线性注意力机制，它在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u441c1a8f" id="u441c1a8f">Gated DeltaNet </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u42c9c0d2" id="u42c9c0d2">的基础上引入更加细粒度的门控机制</span></li><li fid="u149727d4" data-lake-id="ud11f7f9a" id="ud11f7f9a"><span data-lake-id="ud6676b24" id="ud6676b24">GDN 与 Mamba2 类似，采用的是较为粗粒度的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1a63336" id="uc1a63336">逐头遗忘门</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueb575928" id="ueb575928">，即同一个注意力头中的多个特征维度共享统一的遗忘行为</span></li><li fid="u149727d4" data-lake-id="u7742f2a6" id="u7742f2a6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6787c018" id="u6787c018" style="color: #5C0036">KDA 则引入逐通道门控：每个特征维度都拥有独立的遗忘速率，其思想与 Gated Linear Attention（GLA）类似。这种更细粒度的设计能够更加精确地调控有限状态 RNN 中的信息保留与遗忘过程，从而进一步释放 RNN 风格模型在混合架构中的建模潜力</span></strong></li><li fid="u149727d4" data-lake-id="ued0d6a62" id="ued0d6a62"><span data-lake-id="u8bf16920" id="u8bf16920">KDA 使用一种特殊形式的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe16011a" id="ufe16011a">对角加低秩矩阵（Diagonal-Plus-Low-Rank，DPLR）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u92cddd69" id="u92cddd69">对其状态转移动力学进行参数化。基于这一特殊结构，进一步设计一种定制化的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e3375c8" id="u4e3375c8">分块并行算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5d749ca6" id="u5d749ca6">。相比通用 DPLR 形式，该算法能够显著降低计算开销，同时仍与经典 Delta Rule 保持一致</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1179b40f" id="u1179b40f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf33c4dca" id="uf33c4dca">在整体架构上，Kimi Linear 按照统一的 3:1 比例交替排列 KDA 层与全注意力层，即每三个 KDA 层配置一个全注意力层。借助这种混合结构，在长序列生成过程中，模型的内存占用和 KV Cache 使用量最高可降低 75%；与此同时，周期性插入的全注意力层仍能够提供全局信息交互能力，从而避免纯线性注意力在长程信息传播上的局限。本文的主要贡献如下</span></strong></p><ul list="uba34c8d4"><li fid="u3dd33600" data-lake-id="ua3c19196" id="ua3c19196"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12cf5f23" id="u12cf5f23">Kimi Delta Attention</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue535dbf0" id="ue535dbf0">：提出一种新的线性注意力机制，通过更细粒度的门控方式改进 Gated Delta Rule，在提升循环状态记忆管理能力的同时兼顾硬件执行效率</span></li><li fid="u3dd33600" data-lake-id="u1a33b28e" id="u1a33b28e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3aca0dc5" id="u3aca0dc5">Kimi Linear 架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86b5af99" id="u86b5af99">：提出一种按照 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3f0ca01" id="ub3f0ca01">3:1 的 KDA 层与全局注意力层比例</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1fd078e7" id="u1fd078e7">构建的混合架构，在显著降低内存占用的同时，其模型质量能够超过全注意力基线。</span></li><li fid="u3dd33600" data-lake-id="ued0bfbdd" id="ued0bfbdd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7bc07daf" id="u7bc07daf">大规模、公平的实证验证</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4c8b4005" id="u4c8b4005">：在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u72ce59e8" id="u72ce59e8">1.4 万亿 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u98bc7b04" id="u98bc7b04"> 的训练规模下进行对照实验，结果表明 Kimi Linear 在短上下文、长上下文以及 RL 风格评估任务上均优于全注意力及其他基线方法</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6b6d6491" id="u6b6d6491" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786846731256-6dca6f1c-02d0-4575-8963-c0d19ab8488c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5af08984-46d3-4661-bf66-ab8c9a67a45%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u10e4476b-d5f9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A828.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A292%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A68817%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1198%2C%22originHeight%22%3A423%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODINGACCELERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A232%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22128K256K512K1M%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A272%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GDN-H8O.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MA81.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KIMILINEARSL.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MMLU-PRO4K%22%2C%22x%22%3A415%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KIMILINEAR84.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A322%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODINGLENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A93%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A641%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RUJLER(28K%22%2C%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GDNH47.9%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MA47.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A189%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KIMILINEA%22%2C%22x%22%3A708%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226.3X%22%2C%22x%22%3A1122%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GDN-H%22%2C%22x%22%3A707%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224.8X%22%2C%22x%22%3A1017%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%E5%87%A0LA%22%2C%22x%22%3A697%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225.7X%22%2C%22x%22%3A1064%2C%22y%22%3A260%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Y%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C50%22%2C%22x%22%3A515%2C%22y%22%3A348%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2245%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfbfa%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf492af99%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="au3JO" id="au3JO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue4be2dec" id="ue4be2dec">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="ub6e0d92d" id="ub6e0d92d"> 𝐋𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐭𝐚 𝐑𝐮𝐥𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5ed55032" id="u5ed55032"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5833e593" id="u5833e593" style="color: #DF2A3F">线性注意力（Linear Attention）作为在线学习：线性注意力维护一个矩阵形式的循环状态，用于持续累积键–值（key–value）关联</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf6379d01" id="uf6379d01" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bo%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_t.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60fd8255bb1209738123bf8f3963ef86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QpzoF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubbfce92d"><li fid="u2bd4b619" data-lake-id="u2f215553" id="u2f215553"><span data-lake-id="u28fb2802" id="u28fb2802">从快速权重</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u95d967d3" id="u95d967d3">的视角来看，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F507b472be844bd1841aa85a79e2387c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cDTWp%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u26cfc04b" id="u26cfc04b">可以被视为一种联想记忆，用于存储短暂的键到值的映射关系。上述更新过程可以理解为针对一个</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubcf6b974" id="ubcf6b974">无界相关性目标执行梯度下降</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u17eb516e" id="u17eb516e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Clangle%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%20%5C%5Crangle%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19b62839a62b31e9b9e54bfab3a34f64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OpKlt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc5856319"><li fid="u62a3abd9" data-lake-id="u62d5d60a" id="u62d5d60a"><span data-lake-id="u1da8a4b7" id="u1da8a4b7">该目标会持续强化最近出现的键–值对，但</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2077bc80" id="u2077bc80">不包含任何遗忘机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud761fd9b" id="ud761fd9b">。然而，这样的目标函数并没有提供一个明确的判据来决定哪些记忆应当被删除。随着序列不断增长，历史信息会持续累积，从而导致不同记忆之间的干扰在长上下文场景中不断加剧</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucdaa2989" id="ucdaa2989"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0bee771c" id="u0bee771c" style="color: #101E60">DeltaNet 将上述循环更新重新解释为针对一个重构目标进行在线梯度下降，其损失函数定义为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc749ac78" id="uc749ac78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_t(S)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7CS%5E%5C%5Ctop%20k_t-v_t%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95dedab75985efa0220f174b69b6b1d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zXZ4Z%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u459f0dba"><li fid="ua7ce5b13" data-lake-id="u5509df4a" id="u5509df4a"><span data-lake-id="u92486ece" id="u92486ece">以学习率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uDbIN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b48037d" id="u2b48037d">执行一步梯度下降，可以得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3690fcd1" id="u3690fcd1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5CnS_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cnabla_S%20L_t(S_%7Bt-1%7D)%5Cn%3D%5Cn(I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tv_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1b71a5eddd68ddc2018889bc26e93ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qDHBA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud3666d3e"><li fid="ued629bbd" data-lake-id="uda228c71" id="uda228c71"><span data-lake-id="ue69493c4" id="ue69493c4">这一更新规则即经典的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3684b323" id="u3684b323">Delta Rule（增量规则）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3d14e6b" id="ue3d14e6b">。在这种解释下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YFyGj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2362851" id="ud2362851">被视为一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u90cc9558" id="u90cc9558">可学习的联想记忆矩阵</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u49443574" id="u49443574">：当新的键–值对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(k_t%2Cv_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ec6ad352aee012b14fd3ccc2245eed8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AoEeb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud030eba9" id="ud030eba9">到来时，模型并非简单地将其累加进状态，而是持续修正已有记忆，使其逐渐逼近映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k_t%5C%5Cmapsto%20v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e862e3187ae54685b49a975ce57ec9e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cX7bk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1000253e" id="u1000253e">​</span></li><li fid="ued629bbd" data-lake-id="u6d19b96b" id="u6d19b96b"><span data-lake-id="u1a738465" id="u1a738465">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F424c5a1ccdbb5ece64c0f98376beb4c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cM1Uq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29849c84" id="u29849c84">所对应的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7302008" id="ue7302008">rank-1 更新结构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4748a74" id="ue4748a74">可以等价地视为一种广义的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f92fae3" id="u4f92fae3">Householder 变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u28878df0" id="u28878df0">。这种特殊的低秩结构十分适合在硬件上实现高效的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7849a3e9" id="u7849a3e9">分块并行计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ued48cd67" id="ued48cd67">。更直观地说，普通线性注意力的更新是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubddad745" id="ubddad745">直接写入新记忆</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bk_tv_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4258ce148380c212ee8e7acd35147de4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NqcLc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u662b7b11" id="u662b7b11">而 DeltaNet 则首先根据当前状态对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b088a8bc36a53af961a3c97d8052bf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lxnsM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47f5c2c2" id="u47f5c2c2">的预测结果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7Bt-1%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd3b96ebb785a864e8a8458b85201c90c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O5YqF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7fb3341e" id="u7fb3341e">计算误差，然后只写入这一预测误差对应的修正量。因此，它本质上是一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4059e42b" id="u4059e42b">带误差校正的在线记忆更新机制</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1f8d9c1c" id="u1f8d9c1c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u071a2a4c" id="u071a2a4c" style="color: #004347">Gated DeltaNet 将遗忘解释为权重衰减</span></strong></p><ul list="u657840d1"><li fid="u45957407" data-lake-id="u90713fed" id="u90713fed"><span data-lake-id="ufc3c2ed4" id="ufc3c2ed4">尽管 DeltaNet 的重构式更新能够提高记忆学习的稳定性，但它仍然存在一个问题：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua99f1100" id="ua99f1100">过时的关联关系不会被主动遗忘，而可能被长期保留在状态中。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7bc3e36" id="ue7bc3e36">为解决这一问题，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4101c48" id="uc4101c48">Gated DeltaNet </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u42acf602" id="u42acf602">引入一个标量遗忘门</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7dae22ca7d426c764592d7f874990eaa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eZaCw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue474ae5c" id="ue474ae5c">，得到如下更新规则</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d5ceee7" id="u6d5ceee7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t(I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tv_t%5E%5C%5Ctop.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a92a245227ab2adaf8a00ab621aa931.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C9832%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u59748363"><li fid="u21bac569" data-lake-id="ub854ab31" id="ub854ab31"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22whLGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05787d53" id="u05787d53">可以被理解为作用于快速权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F507b472be844bd1841aa85a79e2387c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dUx3z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7a70d43" id="uf7a70d43">上的一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u62b14fc1" id="u62b14fc1">权重衰减</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3e994547" id="u3e994547">。它为模型引入显式的遗忘机制，其作用类似于一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u97b6f858" id="u97b6f858">数据依赖的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12ea5d8dd1e9b2b63ca602dd183dde08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KzVty%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u76bade38" id="u76bade38">正则化</span></strong></li><li fid="u21bac569" data-lake-id="u846e5de3" id="u846e5de3"><span data-lake-id="u85319ae2" id="u85319ae2">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O5Z3g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u500d0d78" id="u500d0d78">接近</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22stg8t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46dfaf6c" id="u46dfaf6c">时，历史状态基本得到保留；而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y6FWb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ddb2976" id="u2ddb2976">较小时，已有记忆会被更强地衰减。因此，模型可以根据当前输入动态控制记忆的生命周期。这种简单但有效的改动，为控制记忆持续时间以及缓解不同历史关联之间的干扰提供一种具有明确理论解释的机制，从而改善模型的训练稳定性和长上下文泛化能力，同时保留 DeltaNet 原有的可并行计算结构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u63a78f47" id="u63a78f47"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04bc0a2f" id="u04bc0a2f">GDN 可以被解释为一种乘法式位置编码。其中，状态转移矩阵并非像传统位置编码那样固定，而是数据依赖且可学习的。因此，与 RoPE 所采用的正交旋转变换相比，GDN 实际上放宽其正交性约束，允许模型学习更加一般化的状态转移动力学</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="wef9d" id="wef9d" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2fe54056" id="u2fe54056">🦊</span><span data-lake-id="u2ee96bf3" id="u2ee96bf3"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud6f8e5f4" id="ud6f8e5f4">𝐊𝐢𝐦𝐢 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐭𝐚 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐭𝐚 𝐑𝐮𝐥𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐞-𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="uf3d4446f" id="uf3d4446f"><span data-lake-id="u177c76bf" id="u177c76bf">KDA 在 GDN 标量衰减机制的基础上进行改进，引入更加细粒度的对角门控矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Calpha_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a33c95cdeddc7b94784d16b6e6d2049.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k2kjK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf70716ef" id="uf70716ef">，从而能够对记忆衰减和位置感知能力进行更精细的控制</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc54437af" id="uc54437af" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%20%3D%20(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop)%20%5C%5Ctextcolor%7B%23C00000%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bo%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb78ad670401b33c36059344e6458135b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hmchk%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uee794896" id="uee794896" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786847615200-ef3e5459-17ba-47cd-bc69-7ebaa799f308.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u29067966-ba35-496f-9160-3c8154ee52e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5850dffb-0232-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A925.6%2C%22height%22%3A102%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A11490%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1157%2C%22originHeight%22%3A127%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf5f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mA7s4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud88cd86a"><li fid="u3b56c47c" data-lake-id="u181001ea" id="u181001ea"><span data-lake-id="ud8098ea0" id="ud8098ea0">通过将上式中的递推关系部分展开为分块（chunk-wise）形式，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4d34b143" id="u4d34b143" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B0%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bj%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ccdot%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F189e2ae3b6f045ba8cffe75d1aaab680.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b9LkU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1b4981e7"><li fid="ucc2ae74e" data-lake-id="u8de1d36b" id="u8de1d36b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93ee454e" id="u93ee454e">WY 表示（WY Representation）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u94195ce8" id="u94195ce8">通常用于将一系列 rank-1 更新压缩为一个紧凑的单一表示。遵循 Comba 中关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1aa7d833e4325eb7767ea337843d646b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NiNes%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f77b381" id="u9f77b381">的构造形式，从而减少后续计算过程中额外进行一次矩阵求逆的需求</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubf288cb8" id="ubf288cb8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Cto%20r%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Cto%20r%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F323f94df645bd40ee19999967b73d2bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rZg6k%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub2c25687"><li fid="u9555d5ca" data-lake-id="ubf8385d6" id="ubf8385d6"><span data-lake-id="ud7e8026d" id="ud7e8026d">其中，辅助向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb8104a5752bfcb0d70ced5cad7724804.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JAVTK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua93a1060" id="ua93a1060">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1fb4648c6b26f73158b9d14d26d9a0a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IgqDk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb8664ab" id="udb8664ab">通过如下递推关系计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uef91f157" id="uef91f157" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Cto%20r%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6db0deaf53f2b1b122f625c8997fbee5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rl8ez%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u324dd384" id="u324dd384" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Cto%20r%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4790f9fb7320785a3e904d87cfef5f67.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WtfjC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u109b87b5"><li fid="u3f8b057b" data-lake-id="u800e2d53" id="u800e2d53"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5e066a4" id="ud5e066a4">UT 变换（UT transform）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uba9fef14" id="uba9fef14">采用 UT 变换来减少非矩阵乘法FLOPs</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubde0f637" id="ubde0f637" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BStrictTril%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd433b4972a6ca75f2196795865ff09d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hedur%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3ef886e5" id="u3ef886e5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8930d7e79c4b6ef6c3187cb38d72c165.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GRDqE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u09821052"><li fid="u59e0d9fa" data-lake-id="ue7f2b0d1" id="ue7f2b0d1"><span data-lake-id="u7546bf2f" id="u7546bf2f">下三角矩阵的逆可以通过高斯消元中的前向代入，以逐行迭代的方式高效计算。等价地，以矩阵形式表示时，可以按照分块方式对状态进行更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4e25b7d6" id="u4e25b7d6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7BC%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Bi%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4bf5f3cecc6d1fdf50ad62c1e9a326ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bKhtM%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc63131c3" id="uc63131c3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786848852467-f236d15e-6583-43e7-920b-287c73199c5d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u121e52e4-5aae-4285-9fad-ee4090873ff%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ude53b80f-ed5c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A560.8%2C%22height%22%3A82%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A8817%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A701%2C%22originHeight%22%3A103%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8e8e2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8b8e6e95%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2eb6a9de"><li fid="u6b80b801" data-lake-id="uc13f5622" id="uc13f5622"><span data-lake-id="u23aa596a" id="u23aa596a">在输出阶段，采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ecb660f" id="u0ecb660f">块间递归与块内并行相结合的策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8ae9500d" id="u8ae9500d">，以最大化矩阵乘法吞吐率，从而充分发挥 Tensor Core 的计算潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub53ff0e0" id="ub53ff0e0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Binter%20chunk%7D%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTril%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Cto%20C%7D%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bintra%20chunk%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%60%60pseudo''-value%20term%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Face49670f2fa14cfe8a687658aebcd16.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BkrFm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf824fb33" id="uf824fb33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786849014429-d3a48c63-fd9b-4965-9720-57601c1837ec.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub62a59d3-0cb6-4d90-8b73-1d38dc140b8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2c75063e-bb41-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A565.6%2C%22height%22%3A74%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A8457%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A707%2C%22originHeight%22%3A93%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9e6de%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u60900db9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35317621" id="u35317621"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1efb49a6" id="u1efb49a6">KDA 和通用 DPLR 一样，都支持细粒度的逐通道衰减，但这种机制容易在 chunk 计算中的除法操作里产生数值精度问题。GLA 通常通过 log 域和 FP32 二级分块来保证稳定性，但会明显拖慢计算。KDA 将 DPLR 中的两个低秩向量都约束为与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78892696c6e1bf5f58b9dcb2afe4b243.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bZTVX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69660153" id="u69660153">相关，使结构更简单，从而减少二级分块和矩阵乘法次数，更充分利用半精度 Tensor Core</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="S3Y06" id="S3Y06" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8f830d25" id="u8f830d25">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="u58d31abb" id="u58d31abb"> 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐊𝐢𝐦𝐢 𝐋𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc17392c3" id="uc17392c3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4445f47" id="ud4445f47" style="color: #DF2A3F">Kimi Linear 的主体架构沿用 Moonlight 的设计。在细粒度门控之外，还引入若干组件，以进一步增强 Kimi Linear 的表达能力</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5784ce22" id="u5784ce22" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786849544268-2ab7e9b5-4893-4e84-9787-443ec7887fde.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1a5667c0-8a12-42a4-8010-1c1bfcf6517%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u6863dba3-cff1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A504.3999938964844%2C%22height%22%3A441%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A92598%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A938%2C%22originHeight%22%3A820%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHAREDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A701%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTEDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A696%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOE%22%2C%22x%22%3A153%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A3%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A57%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221X%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLA%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A565%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A257%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A437%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MOE%22%2C%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A467%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A470%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A567%2C%22y%22%3A506%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A136%2C%22y%22%3A522%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VX%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A560%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KIMIDELTAATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A563%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KDA%22%2C%22x%22%3A146%2C%22y%22%3A617%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A632%2C%22y%22%3A644%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A136%2C%22y%22%3A668%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A685%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMV%22%2C%22x%22%3A538%2C%22y%22%3A686%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A3%B0%E9%87%8F%E5%AD%90%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A697%2C%22width%22%3A360%2C%22height%22%3A73%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEARLINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A440%2C%22y%22%3A720%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cde1ce%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud50d01d6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8dff3c32" id="u8dff3c32"><strong><span data-lake-id="u99051a47" id="u99051a47">神经参数化（Neural Parameterization）：设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57919239ca7139d23aba215278cb3927.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RurcH%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uea9d1c99" id="uea9d1c99">表示第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eyNu5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua376dff5" id="ua376dff5">个 token 的输入表示，则对于每个注意力头</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67df0f404d0960fadcc99f6258733f22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XSH51%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud666e6ea" id="ud666e6ea">，KDA 的输入计算如下</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4b6e4cdb" id="u4b6e4cdb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q_t%5Eh%2C%20k_t%5Eh%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSwish%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnW_%7Bq%2Fk%7D%5Eh%20x_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F904b78688ee262cab390026211b5f203.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cQbFn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u85571b1b" id="u85571b1b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%5Eh%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSwish%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnW_v%5Eh%20x_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29d95d190e5cdce0012270f7c61ffa44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MDgam%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u66b3828a" id="u66b3828a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%5Eh%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cnf%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnW_%5C%5Calpha%5E%5C%5Cuparrow%5CnW_%5C%5Calpha%5E%5C%5Cdownarrow%5Cnx_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5B0%2C1%5D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbf1bd6b370994e46259a346cb4d902f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vg0Np%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3c1122e0" id="u3c1122e0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Eh%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSigmoid%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnW_%5C%5Cbeta%5Eh%20x_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F278100e5677d56a035d68d26ea9a3218.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xzsSk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9de3097a"><li fid="u874ec46c" data-lake-id="ud95c48a4" id="ud95c48a4"><span data-lake-id="u31fdbc2b" id="u31fdbc2b">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dbcade63c0d54d42df63c3aa277d4b1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rc3KQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c111c40" id="u1c111c40">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8b487c22effa35dceb2ed868a0c3d35.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r1qvB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3f1e4e8" id="uc3f1e4e8">分别表示 key 和 value 的 head dimension，在所有实验中二者均被设置为 128，对于上述输入表示，首先应用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u78af8670" id="u78af8670">ShortConv</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub5ece621" id="ub5ece621">，随后使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6423f87f" id="u6423f87f">Swish</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4baff470" id="u4baff470"> 激活函数。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wTE0u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28c65572" id="u28c65572">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UYmKr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7bc0b2fb" id="u7bc0b2fb">的表示，进一步采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u541bbb64" id="u541bbb64">L2Norm</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue0cbf417" id="ue0cbf417"> 进行归一化，以确保特征值的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u874ec46c" data-lake-id="u269fb43b" id="u269fb43b"><span data-lake-id="ub7c66157" id="ub7c66157">逐通道衰减参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%5Eh%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21f67d8b50cf421d715909431e53bc45.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H9uM9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5f47470" id="uf5f47470">通过一个低秩投影进行参数化，即采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_%5C%5Calpha%5E%5C%5Cdownarrow%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba3325a18b4259f18c52fa82bd9cbde3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HA3D4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b474a4f" id="u4b474a4f">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_%5C%5Calpha%5E%5C%5Cuparrow%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb69199fabd268c0e6c3c576050dbdbc0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f32kx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u010b8509" id="u010b8509">，其秩被设置为与 head dimension 相同；同时采用与 GDN 和 Mamba 中类似的衰减函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffaad55346425882be82d51746a394ecd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dHk6r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u407d579f" id="u407d579f">​</span></li><li fid="u874ec46c" data-lake-id="u85458bbe" id="u85458bbe"><span data-lake-id="u8dc35ad4" id="u8dc35ad4">在通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_o%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5a03c6b94fbf30c0ce27f61a9a0494b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22svUlS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d1c11bf" id="u5d1c11bf">进行输出投影之前，采用逐头 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue22c649d" id="ue22c649d">RMSNorm</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86338fec" id="u86338fec">，以及一个数据依赖的门控机制，其参数化形式为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue8f2dfc4" id="ue8f2dfc4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_t%5Cn%3D%5CnW_o%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSigmoid%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnW_g%5E%5C%5Cuparrow%20W_g%5E%5C%5Cdownarrow%20x_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKDA%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cnq_t%2C%5Cnk_t%2C%5Cnv_t%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fedcb56dd9af6162421f704d39dab3de6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TQQC9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uabdc37b3"><li fid="u0da15ee8" data-lake-id="uc4352108" id="uc4352108"><span data-lake-id="u1cfe1a01" id="u1cfe1a01">其中，输出门采用与遗忘门类似的低秩参数化形式；与此同时，该设计能够维持与全秩门控相当的性能，并缓解 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u55ab3f2a" id="u55ab3f2a">Attention Sink</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u35f6bd9a" id="u35f6bd9a"> 问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4103f957" id="u4103f957"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5cc25e65" id="u5cc25e65">混合模型架构：长上下文检索仍然是纯线性注意力的主要瓶颈，因此将 KDA 与少量完整的全局注意力层，即 Full MLA 层进行混合</span></strong></p><ul list="u5a1a6b0c"><li fid="uacbdb5ff" data-lake-id="u5d3a6036" id="u5d3a6036"><span data-lake-id="u393c3779" id="u393c3779">对于 Kimi Linear，选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u19d6e749" id="u19d6e749">逐层（layerwise）混合方式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u771c30b5" id="u771c30b5">，即交替使用完整的不同类型层，而不是采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9357ed87" id="u9357ed87">逐头（headwise）混合方式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud3b01329" id="ud3b01329">，即在同一层内部混合不同类型的注意力头。这一选择主要是因为逐层混合具有更简单的基础设施实现以及更稳定的训练过程</span></li><li fid="uacbdb5ff" data-lake-id="ude49bbee" id="ude49bbee"><span data-lake-id="u599c9804" id="u599c9804">实验结果表明，采用统一的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8b18e597" id="u8b18e597">3:1 比例</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0cf61b6b" id="u0cf61b6b">，即每 3 个 KDA 层之后配置 1 个完整 MLA 层，可以获得最佳的模型质量与吞吐率折中</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5b872d1" id="ua5b872d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub028bee0" id="ub028bee0">MLA 层不使用位置编码（No Position Encoding, NoPE）：在 Kimi Linear 中，对所有完整注意力层均采用 NoPE。这一设计将编码位置信息以及近因偏置的全部职责交由 KDA 层承担</span></strong></p><ul list="ue35d2eb7"><li fid="u6d6941c4" data-lake-id="u379ed3cb" id="u379ed3cb"><span data-lake-id="ucd39e133" id="ucd39e133">KDA 被确立为模型中主要的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e0a1203" id="u4e0a1203">位置感知算子</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u404b5dca" id="u404b5dca">，其作用类似于、甚至可以认为强于短卷积或 SWA 等辅助组件，将全局 NoPE 注意力与专门的位置感知机制相结合，可以获得具有竞争力的长上下文性能</span></li><li fid="u6d6941c4" data-lake-id="u049064fa" id="u049064fa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64d42560" id="u64d42560">NoPE 在实际应用中具有多方面优势，尤其适用于 MLA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u98ac798d" id="u98ac798d">。首先，NoPE 使得 MLA 在推理阶段能够转换为高效的纯 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u920b24d7" id="u920b24d7">Multi-Query Attention</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u80f9ebeb" id="u80f9ebeb">。其次，NoPE 简化长上下文训练，因为它无需再对 RoPE 的相关参数进行调整，例如调整频率基数，或者采用 YaRN 等上下文扩展方法</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="U5YGf" id="U5YGf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8a92764d" id="u8a92764d">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u7b6d76c6" id="u7b6d76c6"> 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭</span></h2><ul list="ue071033c"><li fid="u70a6c027" data-lake-id="u8f3563da" id="u8f3563da"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d3e8f1a" id="u2d3e8f1a">细粒度衰减显著提升有限状态记忆的选择性与稳定性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f915acf" id="u1f915acf">相较于 GDN 的标量衰减，KDA 的逐通道衰减能够更精确地控制信息保留与遗忘。在 Palindrome、MQAR 和 Stack 等记忆密集型任务上，KDA 随序列长度增长始终表现最优，并在检索任务上表现出更快的收敛速度，说明 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9451643f" id="u9451643f">fine-grained decay 与 delta-rule 更新具有互补作用</span></strong></li><li fid="u70a6c027" data-lake-id="u28e58ced" id="u28e58ced"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c308428" id="u3c308428">线性注意力与全局注意力之间存在明确的最优混合比例，而非全注意力越多越好：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8b471bc3" id="u8b471bc3">实验表明，3:1 的 KDA/MLA 比例在训练损失、泛化性能与推理开销之间取得最佳平衡。进一步增加 KDA 比例会损害验证性能，而增加 MLA 比例则带来额外推理成本。这表明少量全局注意力足以弥补线性状态在全局检索上的局限</span></li><li fid="u70a6c027" data-lake-id="u9c846a6b" id="u9c846a6b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6cbddcb" id="uc6cbddcb">局部建模与输出调制对 KDA 的整体性能具有不可忽视的贡献：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u918519c4" id="u918519c4">移除 output gate 会导致性能下降，而 Sigmoid gate 明显优于 Swish gate；同时，去除 ShortConv 也会带来验证性能退化。这说明 Kimi Linear 的性能提升并非仅来源于新的 recurrent update，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u012acc91" id="u012acc91">局部卷积所提供的短程归纳偏置，以及输出门控对信息流的动态调制，同样是架构有效性的关键组成部分</span></strong></li><li fid="u70a6c027" data-lake-id="u4119d0a0" id="u4119d0a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue82eebda" id="ue82eebda">位置建模与全局内容检索的功能解耦有利于长上下文泛化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u68e5ee0e" id="u68e5ee0e">Kimi Linear 使用 KDA 承担主要的位置感知功能，而 MLA 层采用 NoPE。相较于 RoPE 版本，该设计在短上下文性能基本不受影响的情况下显著改善长上下文表现，说明避免在全局注意力层中引入过强的位置偏置，有助于模型向更长序列外推</span></li><li fid="u70a6c027" data-lake-id="u0676cb56" id="u0676cb56"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud440800e" id="ud440800e">KDA 的优势不仅体现为推理效率，还表现为更优的训练与 RL 扩展特性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uff1105eb" id="uff1105eb">Kimi Linear 在 compute-optimal scaling 下获得约 1.16× 的计算效率，同时在 RL 阶段表现出比 MLA 更快的训练和测试性能提升</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="KLNe6" id="KLNe6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u504e5ac5" id="u504e5ac5">🦊</span><span data-lake-id="ub0e6665e" id="ub0e6665e"> 𝐊𝐢𝐦𝐢 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐭𝐚 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐬 𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐩𝐨𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐞𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub6b0c47e" id="ub6b0c47e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd142720" id="ubd142720">标准 Transformer 注意力机制在设计上对输入序列的顺序是不可知的，因此必须显式引入位置编码。在各种位置编码方法中，RoPE 凭借其有效性，已经成为现代大语言模型中事实上的标准方案。类似 RoPE 的乘法式位置编码机制，可以通过如下广义注意力形式进行分析</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5feb4ba5" id="u5feb4ba5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_j%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F447d24141234532d59c9071348e54606.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LpN7v%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u05aaf1c6"><li fid="u010fe666" data-lake-id="ud02eaaf2" id="ud02eaaf2"><span data-lake-id="uc0360c83" id="uc0360c83">其中，第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QN3mK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa310c06" id="ufa310c06">个 query </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd14b41b7b20149f4317ef8fc99d13987.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DkrhU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub78f02d7" id="ub78f02d7">与第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rek5Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4286542" id="ud4286542">个 key </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6944addf2750fddf1f0b5ba43664c3e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oKuMx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d6e82c2" id="u1d6e82c2">之间的位置关系，通过累积矩阵乘积体现。RoPE 将变换矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa0d5197b94ef85a1c32732a3c158eca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B7kSm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud00c7344" id="ud00c7344">定义为由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_k%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98cade0a19d2c597acbfbab6104442cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUyVI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d0c79d9" id="u3d0c79d9">个二维旋转矩阵构成的块对角矩阵，其中第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pcvvc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92aa7f24" id="u92aa7f24">个二维旋转块为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc3256c06" id="uc3256c06" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_j%5Ek%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccos(j%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin(j%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin(j%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos(j%5C%5Ctheta_k)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bf693217f7c1763ab8c4c9a13841d8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z9xGA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud49cd144"><li fid="u8576df96" data-lake-id="u2d4711b7" id="u2d4711b7"><span data-lake-id="u49015b6a" id="u49015b6a">其对应的每二维角频率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc0d51862fa4869b0a27ace5ba937456a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WP6zr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71bd7afb" id="u71bd7afb">。利用旋转矩阵的性质，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_%7Bt-i%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d1641233b39e3aeca5d7097f0613d1d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UqP7v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c4f92da" id="u8c4f92da">，绝对位置信息</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e819e60c68969b8e5de8942bd841277.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xzkQI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5552ba77" id="u5552ba77">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F842262380465be6f0f4f5401b1296ee4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cnol7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcb0c5b5" id="ufcb0c5b5">可以分别作用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd14b41b7b20149f4317ef8fc99d13987.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BXayk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce36ceed" id="uce36ceed">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6944addf2750fddf1f0b5ba43664c3e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YXGW7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12ee63c6" id="u12ee63c6">，随后被转换为相对位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t-i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73562be0e868b587ff26e7847470bc6d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jlTOF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u893472cc" id="u893472cc">的编码</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3373b22e" id="u3373b22e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_j%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccos((t-i)%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin((t-i)%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin((t-i)%5C%5Ctheta_k)%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos((t-i)%5C%5Ctheta_k)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a0f931aa6372470397f4ac4400f463d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YFcfg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u42eb199b"><li fid="u82361d10" data-lake-id="u81a25148" id="u81a25148"><span data-lake-id="u086e03c8" id="u086e03c8">进一步地，采用 gated delta rule 的线性注意力也可以写成与之可比较的形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e3b5301" id="u6e3b5301" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D_j%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_j%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_j%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9410338002b7f302ff9aab14be2ddf79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mlJrq%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u31c006c0"><li fid="ud1421763" data-lake-id="u8df87ecd" id="u8df87ecd"><span data-lake-id="u9a41bbc4" id="u9a41bbc4">GDN 可以被解释为一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufde81a19" id="ufde81a19">乘法式位置编码</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc4cc5c55" id="uc4cc5c55">：其状态转移矩阵由数据动态决定，因此放宽 RoPE 所施加的正交性约束，并可能具备更强的表达能力。这一性质也为缓解 RoPE 已知的外推问题提供一种潜在解决方案，因为 RoPE 的固定频率可能使模型过拟合于训练阶段所见的上下文长度。近期一些工作采用 partial RoPE 等折中方案，甚至完全取消显式位置编码，即 NoPE</span></li><li fid="ud1421763" data-lake-id="u0c29e02d" id="u0c29e02d"><span data-lake-id="ud1b7d827" id="ud1b7d827">鉴于 GDN 在功能上承担类似 RoPE 的角色，在模型的全局完整注意力层中采用 NoPE，使位置信息能够由所提出的 KDA 动态建模。</span></li><li fid="ud1421763" data-lake-id="ubd5d473c" id="ubd5d473c"><span data-lake-id="ub73f523e" id="ub73f523e">RoPE 的一个重要优势在于其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue4222af4" id="ue4222af4">细粒度位置编码能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uab80d24a" id="uab80d24a">：它为不同的二维特征对分配不同的旋转频率，其作用类似于沿特征维度执行非均匀傅里叶变换。相比之下，标准 GDN 对每个 attention head 仅采用单一标量 decay，缺少这种逐维度的多样性。因此，进一步提出带有</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b046590" id="u2b046590">可学习逐通道门控</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf767b381" id="uf767b381">的 KDA</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub05a7e4b" id="ub05a7e4b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786851275950-49d10002-b2fa-4006-9605-d044ca53ad0c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufa2afaf7-ea55-499e-8abb-653808b330c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u08f45c42-a746-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A727.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A461%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A203479%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1099%2C%22originHeight%22%3A697%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22O(K)U%3B(EXP(QKT)OM)(I%2BEXP(WKT)OM-)V%22%2C%22x%22%3A474%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A494%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(QKTOAOM%2BKKTOAOM-)%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A341%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22((QOF()TOM1I%2BKOD)()TOM-)%22%2C%22x%22%3A577%2C%22y%22%3A651%2C%22width%22%3A423%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KTOAOMI%2BKKTO-LOM-V%22%2C%22x%22%3A590%2C%22y%22%3A550%2C%22width%22%3A376%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T(EXP((QKTOMI%2BWWTOM-))OAOMV%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A488%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(EXP(R(Q)R(KTOMV%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A96%2C%22width%22%3A246%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22((QOF()OMV%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A2