A100%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GI%22%2C%22x%22%3A176%2C%22y%22%3A608%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(QKO%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A520%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)K3%22%2C%22x%22%3A351%2C%22y%22%3A298%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A385%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22x%22%3A351%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A657%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%892%E5%8D%811%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A475%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A174%2C%22y%22%3A554%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u588eab3f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0dc84944" id="u0dc84944"><strong><span data-lake-id="u333a139a" id="u333a139a" style="color: #C75C00">(Gated) DeltaNet 可以推广至表达能力更强的 Diagonal-Plus-Low-Rank（DPLR） 结构，其形式定义为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30742c3221978dc0773a2b5219d114a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oNXvU%22%7D" style="color: #C75C00"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u765e3252" id="u765e3252" style="color: #C75C00">。类似结构也曾在 S4 等模型中得到研究，其中采用静态 DPLR 形式作为状态转移矩阵。在实际计算中，该矩阵通常会被联合对角化到复数域，从而使其表达能力受到对角变换的限制</span></strong></p><ul list="u457090a8"><li fid="u670a4412" data-lake-id="uc90b8df8" id="uc90b8df8"><span data-lake-id="u2f9acf99" id="u2f9acf99">虽然 DPLR 结构能够引入更丰富的模型交互，并可能通过其 key-value 更新规则增强信息召回能力，但它也存在一个显著局限：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue520b1e0" id="ue520b1e0">计算成本较高且并行化能力较弱</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub838cfcd" id="ub838cfcd">。这使得 DPLR 在大规模训练或实时推理场景下天然较慢，因此如何同时保持参数效率与计算效率成为一个重要的设计挑战</span></li><li fid="u670a4412" data-lake-id="uead709ba" id="uead709ba"><span data-lake-id="u509d2550" id="u509d2550">为解决这一问题，KDA 引入 DPLR 的一种受约束变体</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ea1a6ce" id="u6ea1a6ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26420be718fdecc91c15e7fef5b332f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nXE8e%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud7cff298" id="ud7cff298" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bs.t.%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F340f6cd4b70f7e6e0cce824afe602207.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pPvIQ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2aa4e75f"><li fid="u7a421072" data-lake-id="u9a9c358f" id="u9a9c358f"><span data-lake-id="u317f5424" id="u317f5424">通过将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdcb6a42e3f28ba12f1b62cadaabec9d8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mqgFY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3b3d81c" id="ue3b3d81c">提取出来，KDA 可以像 GLA 一样对状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbd74fcf1e5de0b2c29a4fdf6435decd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Syxwx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f6b0a7f" id="u1f6b0a7f">实现细粒度的乘法衰减，随后再执行类似 DeltaNet 的 Householder-style transformation，从而实现高效的状态更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3e60f0b6" id="u3e60f0b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1786851451476-59a0f926-96f1-4343-a473-de8460177df6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc38aa1c1-750b-4025-8fb0-0610ce551fa%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u08f45c42-a746-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A880%2C%22height%22%3A386%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A148291%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1100%2C%22originHeight%22%3A483%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORGDNANDKDA%2CTHEUPDATECANBEVIEWEDASPERFOMINGANSOCHASTICGORUDIENTDESENT(SGD)PROESONTHEDECAYEDSTATES%2CTHATIS%2CS%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A436%2C%22width%22%3A1055%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(SL(1-A)%2CU)%2BV%2FDIAG(1-A0JS%3A-%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A199%2C%22width%22%3A417%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3DDIAG(A)-(B.OK.KS-1%2BKRUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A672%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A383%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(SLK%2CU)%2B%2FDIAG(1-ARJS-.%22%2C%22x%22%3A223%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A344%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SK%3A-U%3A%2BV%2FDIAG(1-A)S-.%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A373%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B2%A4S-K-U%2BV%2F1-AS-%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A317%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B(SK%2CU0)%E5%8D%81V%2F1-AS-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A219%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A302%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%2C-VC%2CWHERES-ISDECAYEDBYSCALARORHNEGRANEDGATC.%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A457%2C%22width%22%3A570%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-I-IKKS-1%2BBKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A674%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A325%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3DAT-BKKS-I%E5%8D%81BKU!%22%2C%22x%22%3A671%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A294%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3D(T-BKKT)DIAG(A)S-1%E5%8D%81BKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A399%2C%22width%22%3A374%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B(SK%2CU)%2BV1-AS-%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A216%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UPDATEULES%3DST-1-VS-C%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A256%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3DAS-1%E5%8D%81BKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3D1-BK)AS-1%E5%8D%81BKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A294%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-AST-1%E5%8D%81BKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222SI-IKT-UTDIAXCG%22%2C%22x%22%3A211%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A215%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-DIAG(AT)ST-1%E5%8D%81(1-A)U%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A271%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3DST-1%E5%8D%81%E2%80%B00%22%2C%22x%22%3A677%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-SI_K%2COE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RWKV771%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AMBA2%5B1O%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%97S-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A215%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%E4%B8%89DIAG(OT)ST-1%E5%8D%81O%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B7S%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A202%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RETNET%5B92%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMBA%5B40%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONGHORN%5B59%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HGRN2%5B77%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OBJECTIVEC%22%2C%22x%22%3A215%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KDA(OUURS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A399%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LA%5B48%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GLA%5B114%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GDN%5B11I%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4e2182cd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ODAlw" id="ODAlw" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5425edb3" id="u5425edb3">🦁</span><span data-lake-id="ufd4f2aff" id="ufd4f2aff"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub83fbc14" id="ub83fbc14"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65aa2f35" id="u65aa2f35">线性注意力的演进，本质上是从降低复杂度逐步转向提高有限状态记忆的可控性。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u764beab8" id="u764beab8">最早的线性注意力主要利用矩阵乘法的结合律，将显式的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20T%C3%97T%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7cc18bf1d38b95e2cc014d6bbba01b88.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22te3Wg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubffde9da" id="ubffde9da">注意力矩阵转化为固定大小的矩阵状态，从而使计算复杂度关于序列长度呈线性增长</span></p><ul list="uc225f85b"><li fid="u02875352" data-lake-id="u907709f6" id="u907709f6"><span data-lake-id="u15600cb8" id="u15600cb8">这种简单形式缺少 Softmax 注意力所具有的选择能力：历史信息不断被压缩进同一个有限状态，容易产生记忆干扰。因此，后续工作的重点并非继续降低理论复杂度，而是不断增强</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u698ca134" id="u698ca134">状态转移机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u48c132c6" id="u48c132c6">：从 RetNet 的数据无关标量衰减，到 Mamba2 的数据依赖标量衰减，再到 GLA 的逐通道对角门控</span></li><li fid="u02875352" data-lake-id="u928f8411" id="u928f8411"><span data-lake-id="uf2718551" id="uf2718551">研究重点逐渐从能否压缩历史转向</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a8f8a95" id="u7a8f8a95">应该以什么粒度决定哪些历史被保留、哪些被遗忘</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue08c607a" id="ue08c607a">。KDA 延续这一方向，并将细粒度逐通道衰减与 Delta Rule 结合，使有限状态既具有选择性遗忘能力，也具有基于误差的记忆修正能力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u35af5dfc" id="u35af5dfc"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf945e8e4" id="uf945e8e4">从快速权重记忆的视角看，Delta Rule 改变的不只是门控形式，而是线性注意力的写入机制</span></strong></p><ul list="u6192c7d9"><li fid="ue04f4168" data-lake-id="u062f341f" id="u062f341f"><span data-lake-id="ue069ff0f" id="ue069ff0f">论文将线性注意力的循环状态视为一个低容量的联想记忆：慢权重负责学习何时存储、更新和遗忘信息，而快速权重状态则在线维护当前上下文中的键值关联。普通门控或衰减主要解决“旧记忆应该衰减多少”的问题，但并未从根本上改变新信息的写入方式</span></li><li fid="ue04f4168" data-lake-id="u47ad91c3" id="u47ad91c3"><span data-lake-id="uce3d9e0b" id="uce3d9e0b">GDN/KDA 中的 gated delta rule 则进一步引入秩 1 纠错更新，使状态能够根据当前键值映射误差对已有记忆进行修正。因此，这里实际上包含两个相对独立的维度：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u534b6093" id="u534b6093">门控决定记忆能够保留多久，Delta Rule 决定记忆应该如何被修正</span></strong></li><li fid="ue04f4168" data-lake-id="ua3de48b6" id="ua3de48b6"><span data-lake-id="ub72b4e29" id="ub72b4e29">KDA 的意义就在于同时增强这两个维度：逐通道衰减提升遗忘的选择性，而 Delta 更新提升记忆写入与纠错能力 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2ef2c045" id="u2ef2c045"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1fe08ea9" id="u1fe08ea9">线性注意力与稀疏注意力的根本区别，是压缩历史与保留历史后选择性访问两种不同的记忆范式</span></strong></p><ul list="u7145c688"><li fid="ucb76f42d" data-lake-id="u08cb5794" id="u08cb5794"><span data-lake-id="u3475554c" id="u3475554c">稀疏注意力并没有真正消除历史表示，而是通过滑动窗口、路由、聚类、top-k 分块选择等方式，仅计算其中一部分 token。因此，它在精确检索和细粒度选择上通常更具优势，因为原始 KV 信息仍然可以访问；代价则是仍需维护随序列长度增长的 KV Cache，同时动态选择本身也可能引入不可忽略的额外开销</span></li><li fid="ucb76f42d" data-lake-id="u12e29a73" id="u12e29a73"><span data-lake-id="u4d239f63" id="u4d239f63">NSA、MoBA、DSA 等近期方法开始强调软硬件协同设计，本质上就是为让稀疏选择真正转化为 kernel 层面的实际加速。线性注意力则采用完全不同的策略：直接将历史压缩进固定大小的状态，因此在解码阶段具有更好的内存扩展特性，但也不可避免地形成信息瓶颈</span></li><li fid="ucb76f42d" data-lake-id="u0d3bd99b" id="u0d3bd99b"><span data-lake-id="u7fba95c9" id="u7fba95c9">模型并非保存并检索完整历史，而是学习一个足以支持后续预测的压缩状态。因此，两者的核心权衡可以概括为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2eb84a2c" id="u2eb84a2c">稀疏注意力通过保留信息换取检索精度，线性注意力通过压缩信息换取状态存储与解码效率</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5d91c557" id="u5d91c557"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4cb9eebd" id="u4cb9eebd">混合注意力的作用并非简单折中计算复杂度，而是显式弥补有限状态模型在精确随机访问上的结构性缺陷</span></strong></p><ul list="u826ccfa1"><li fid="u6c1ae379" data-lake-id="uf820476d" id="uf820476d"><span data-lake-id="ub2e19855" id="ub2e19855">论文明确指出，即使加入门控和 Delta Rule，纯线性注意力在精确复制和极长上下文中的精确检索上仍然存在天然劣势。因此，混合架构的逻辑并不是简单地加入部分全注意力以提高性能，而是让两类机制承担不同职责：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubffc112d" id="ubffc112d">KDA 负责大部分层中的状态压缩、持续记忆和高效更新；全注意力则周期性提供对完整历史的全局访问与精确检索能力</span></strong></li><li fid="u6c1ae379" data-lake-id="u30550162" id="u30550162"><span data-lake-id="u729339ec" id="u729339ec">在具体实现上，混合方式又可以分为层内混合与层间混合。前者在同一层内混合不同类型的注意力头或 token 混合机制，表达更加灵活，但会引入多条计算路径，并增加缓存管理和分布式并行的复杂度；因此 Kimi Linear 选择固定比例的层间混合，使每层保持统一的计算形式，并采用 3:1 的 KDA/全注意力周期。这体现出明显的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ee11951" id="u5ee11951">算法与系统协同设计</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u339e29fa" id="u339e29fa">：模型结构不仅服务于建模能力，也主动适配现有的并行、缓存与推理基础设施</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u04f003f2" id="u04f003f2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u975ae5a5" id="u975ae5a5">NoPE 的选择进一步体现 Kimi Linear 对位置建模和内容检索的功能解耦</span></strong></p><ul list="uf8525bfe"><li fid="u8ec6932c" data-lake-id="ue40a8702" id="ue40a8702"><span data-lake-id="u7ec9ca87" id="u7ec9ca87">如果混合架构中的线性注意力与全注意力都携带较强的位置偏置，不同层就可能承担重复甚至不一致的位置建模职责；与此同时，RoPE 的基频参数对上下文扩展较为敏感</span></li><li fid="u8ec6932c" data-lake-id="uef4ed0f5" id="uef4ed0f5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bec10f1" id="u2bec10f1">KDA 的数据依赖状态转移负责位置与近因信息建模，而全注意力层采用 NoPE，主要负责全局内容交互与精确检索</span></strong></li><li fid="u8ec6932c" data-lake-id="u1bc2fcb2" id="u1bc2fcb2"><span data-lake-id="u9ac79fad" id="u9ac79fad">将位置感知从显式、固定频率的位置编码，转化为由循环状态动力学动态产生的位置归纳偏置。全注意力层无需再通过调整 RoPE 基频、YaRN 等方法适配更长上下文，也降低混合架构在上下文扩展过程中的位置编码耦合</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="BxmFX" id="BxmFX" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufe75dc9f" id="ufe75dc9f">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="udaaa1e7f" id="udaaa1e7f"> 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐭𝐚𝐍𝐞𝐭-𝟐: 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐄𝐫𝐚𝐬𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐖𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐞 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u6459b68d" id="u6459b68d"><span data-lake-id="uaab82943" id="uaab82943">线性递归注意力以固定大小的递归状态替代显式注意力矩阵，将序列混合转化为线性时间复杂度的递归计算，其内存开销不再随上下文长度增长。这一设计的吸引力十分明确，但其约束同样明显：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6593d6ef" id="u6593d6ef">递归状态本质上是一种压缩的键值记忆，而在长上下文条件下，大量关联关系必须共享同一个有限容量的状态空间，从而使精确检索变得困难。近期工作通过增强递归机制对信息保留行为的控制能力，持续改善这一记忆瓶颈</span></strong></p><ul list="u78e65876"><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="uedab8223" id="uedab8223"><span data-lake-id="u10fbbe98" id="u10fbbe98">Mamba-2 使用数据依赖的衰减机制来调节记忆时间跨度</span></li><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="ua56fa7bb" id="ua56fa7bb"><span data-lake-id="u89c1d144" id="u89c1d144">DeltaNet 将简单的加性写入替换为 delta rule，使模型能够有针对性地覆盖由当前 key 所寻址的关联信息</span></li><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="ubdaff29b" id="ubdaff29b"><span data-lake-id="ucb711ad4" id="ucb711ad4">Gated DeltaNet 进一步将 delta rule 与可学习的衰减门结合，使状态同时具备全局遗忘和定向编辑能力</span></li><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="u1921163c" id="u1921163c"><span data-lake-id="uff6c478c" id="uff6c478c">Kimi Delta Attention 则在衰减机制上进一步细化，在 key 维度引入逐通道遗忘机制</span></li><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="u580dad6b" id="u580dad6b"><span data-lake-id="u0047e21c" id="u0047e21c">Mamba-3 沿状态空间模型路线继续推进，通过指数—梯形离散化、复值状态转移，以及多输入多输出形式，构建能力更强且效率更高的递归机制</span></li><li fid="u69195051" data-lake-id="ub63f4cb1" id="ub63f4cb1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8355d32a" id="u8355d32a" style="color: #601BDE">这些进展显著推动递归线性模型的发展，同时也使 delta-rule 记忆中尚未解决的瓶颈更加清晰：当前的主动编辑机制仍使用同一个标量门，同时控制旧信息的擦除与新信息的写入</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uef60231a" id="uef60231a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf154398a" id="uf154398a" style="color: #DF2A3F">Gated DeltaNet-2，一种在 delta rule 中将擦除（erase）与写入（write）操作解耦的递归注意力层</span></strong></p><ul list="u39c279c8"><li fid="u3c814d87" data-lake-id="uee207b5c" id="uee207b5c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a021d74" id="u9a021d74" style="color: #004347">将二者绑定到同一个标量上，本质上是一种建模约束，因为擦除和写入实际上作用于状态的不同轴。擦除属于 key 侧操作，其作用是决定旧有读出结果中的哪些坐标应被移除；而写入属于 value 侧操作，其作用是决定输入 value 中的哪些坐标应真正写入并保存在状态中</span></strong></li><li fid="u3c814d87" data-lake-id="ufb32e45e" id="ufb32e45e"><span data-lake-id="ued10c13d" id="ued10c13d">Gated DeltaNet-2 保留 KDA 的逐通道衰减机制，但将原先绑定的标量 delta gate 替换为两个相互独立的门控：一个作用于 key 轴的逐通道 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ff7298e" id="u9ff7298e">erase gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u09110512" id="u09110512">，以及一个作用于 value 轴的逐通道 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u00adfb65" id="u00adfb65">write gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufed0931c" id="ufed0931c">。由此，模型可以通过 decay 清除大范围的上下文信息，通过 erase 移除特定的陈旧关联，并通过 write 仅写入那些真正需要长期保留的 value 通道</span></li><li fid="u3c814d87" data-lake-id="ufa3206eb" id="ufa3206eb"><span data-lake-id="u2b8227ec" id="u2b8227ec">当 erase gate 与 write gate 被约束为同一个标量时，Gated DeltaNet-2 退化为 KDA；若进一步将 decay 也约束为标量，则可恢复为 Gated DeltaNet</span></li><li fid="u3c814d87" data-lake-id="uc6f55586" id="uc6f55586"><span data-lake-id="ucc8b0186" id="ucc8b0186">通过将累积的逐通道衰减吸收到秩一的 erase 因子中，该递归形式可以被改写为紧凑的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3626a35d" id="u3626a35d">WY 表示</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1bd9add4" id="u1bd9add4">，并保持与现有高效 delta-rule kernel 相同的高层分块计算结构</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="pPi9c" id="pPi9c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u072cbf2e" id="u072cbf2e">🐢</span><span data-lake-id="u7889568a" id="u7889568a"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u49c4e050" id="u49c4e050"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubdf33b54" id="ubdf33b54">作为递归状态的线性注意力：考虑单个注意力头</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd8e0c62f247b739a096c800d70dbd4ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PQDXy%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38498c30" id="u38498c30">，并省略层索引。递归线性注意力层维护一个矩阵状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93dae3b8c48f3a6e2e38c0d47307a4aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XCKWS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u06a34a27" id="u06a34a27">，并利用 query 从该状态中读取信息</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u43c2fcad" id="u43c2fcad" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%20%3D%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%20%2B%20k_t%20v_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cno_t%20%3D%20S_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20q_t.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b6a6cbe7675ad679fe02d628c0e9d63.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pgrw4%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub845bbe4"><li fid="udf7295bb" data-lake-id="ub4e894fc" id="ub4e894fc"><span data-lake-id="u4b8d85b3" id="u4b8d85b3">将该递归关系在长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8145d7bcb33722e68000f92a254a8124.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nh9UR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87cdd605" id="u87cdd605">的序列上展开，可以得到熟悉的因果矩阵形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1f9d6750" id="u1f9d6750" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(QK%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Codot%20M%5C%5Cright)V.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F803d648b0f35d985487cc4ab28f276ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mEKOw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufc5ad824"><li fid="u04a5fa46" data-lake-id="ufbf97ce4" id="ufbf97ce4"><span data-lake-id="u66b816e9" id="u66b816e9">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X9it4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2873ab90" id="u2873ab90">为因果掩码。状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20S_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e16559339cf76b0f378096f0f82c15a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qO7Bz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue65ca5da" id="ue65ca5da">的大小与序列长度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RqC02%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28de7a3d" id="u28de7a3d">无关，而并行形式则通过矩阵乘法替代逐 token 的递归计算</span></li><li fid="u04a5fa46" data-lake-id="u380ca075" id="u380ca075"><strong><span data-lake-id="u70ddc001" id="u70ddc001" style="color: #663000">每一个外积都会被累加到状态中，却没有任何内容被显式移除。旧的关联会一直保留在状态中，直到后续写入通过叠加的方式间接覆盖它们</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3c999e91" id="u3c999e91"><strong><span data-lake-id="u77da1485" id="u77da1485">Chunkwise 形式：高效的线性递归层在训练过程中通常采用 chunkwise 调度方式。将序列划分为大小为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc831a24d5fe960188e5fc27ccff3a4c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CqySc%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u65e6e6a6" id="u65e6e6a6">的若干 chunk。令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Q_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%2C%20K_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%2C%20V_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2afeef3bfbf19a9f912c7cb0eee9c2cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NlNw6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uef782ba0" id="uef782ba0">分别表示 query、key 和 value 块，并令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20S_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07d056cf7001805cd7e08661df9adab6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SDJZ1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc194e478" id="uc194e478">表示该 chunk 开始时的状态。对递归关系进行部分展开，可得</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u809731a4" id="u809731a4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bn%2B1%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5CnS_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5Cn%2B%5CnK_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DV_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnO_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5Cn%3D%5CnQ_%7B%5Bn%5D%7DS_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnQ_%7B%5Bn%5D%7DK_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5CnM_C%5Cn%5C%5Cright)V_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F016d534c090f115339f990cad2ad29d2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ezt3f%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0f561498"><li fid="u3199a5e4" data-lake-id="ud96231eb" id="ud96231eb"><span data-lake-id="u06e34238" id="u06e34238">递归仅存在于不同 chunk 之间，而一个 chunk 内所有 token 之间的交互都可以表示为稠密矩阵乘法。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc831a24d5fe960188e5fc27ccff3a4c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TaJZs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9aa0660" id="ub9aa0660">固定时，这一方法仍然保持关于序列长度的线性复杂度，同时能够很好地映射到 Tensor Core 上执行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62b8f86e" id="u62b8f86e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a8187e1" id="u6a8187e1">Mamba-2 在每次写入之前引入一个数据依赖的标量衰减因子</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1b81e7a3" id="u1b81e7a3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cnk_t%20v_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%20%5C%5Cin%20(0%2C1%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F504ca3cd90e2f1f146dc8063bb2a480e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nBJ1F%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u82d4e593"><li fid="u99b47eea" data-lake-id="u3ebc6592" id="u3ebc6592"><span data-lake-id="uccb1795a" id="uccb1795a">这一衰减机制赋予模型一种全局遗忘操作。若定义</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5C%5Calpha_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1597b0d7e40c510640ba6c7f923a79f9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zHSgM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u22cb933c" id="u22cb933c">，那么在时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EslTt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud11e4aae" id="ud11e4aae">读取更早时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oKlY0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9619bf7" id="ue9619bf7">写入的信息时，对应的缩放因子为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_t%2F%5C%5Cgamma_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4258510a3b9623bbd82f4d4af605f142.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vwhTx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued591ba7" id="ued591ba7">。由此可以得到一个考虑衰减的注意力掩码，同时仍然保持式 (3) 中的 chunkwise 计算结构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucd40d20b" id="ucd40d20b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u47284b85" id="u47284b85">DeltaNet 则采用另一种方式，为状态引入主动编辑操作。在写入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa82a3611eda9bb00760ef2cb38ee9e7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bELUu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbb7bbc5" id="ufbb7bbc5">之前，模型首先读取当前与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F78892696c6e1bf5f58b9dcb2afe4b243.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nQD8A%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf67886e7" id="uf67886e7">相关联的 value，并将其从状态中减去。对于标量步长</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5604badaee400eb55acd1722e6ec3594.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UUw6m%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u430fe089" id="u430fe089">，其更新形式为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2adf8c6d" id="u2adf8c6d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5CnS_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_t%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cnv_t%20-%20S_%7Bt-1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dk_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnI-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tk_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)S_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tv_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe76634a75a55dbbb704e74caed1ac250.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22af9wG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u716cc8eb"><li fid="ub92744f9" data-lake-id="ua3ccdab5" id="ua3ccdab5"><span data-lake-id="u84b6bc4e" id="u84b6bc4e">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5ClVert%20k_t%5C%5CrVert_2%3D1%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F13e0ef38114c23da04d0e2548e722179.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RH0ik%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcdb9278" id="ubcdb9278">时，矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20k_tk_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feaee0c5ac55baaf79b46289c6cb56eb1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BTTtC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32f3cd44" id="u32f3cd44">是一个投影矩阵。因此，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F457e93382f3c71ec099df838283914fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rQzcI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub643986f" id="ub643986f">时，该操作会覆盖</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20key%20(k_t)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67459b5676de348f34970e39d4793eaa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CPdWB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca039913" id="uca039913">所对应的关联；而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4545c00c23ae189927ef46cdb6bfaa8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T9zXM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5834d8a" id="ud5834d8a">时，该关联保持不变</span></li><li fid="ub92744f9" data-lake-id="u1b304ac7" id="u1b304ac7"><span data-lake-id="u85e3490e" id="u85e3490e">从 fast-weight 的视角来看，上式等价于针对如下局部回归损失执行一步在线梯度更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5CnS%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dk_t-v_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa4c5022db83a4aa7c663c10d65384f56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EtpJz%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e51a4f9" id="u6e51a4f9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5e5c24ad" id="u5e5c24ad">Gated DeltaNet 将上述两种操作结合起来，decay 对整个状态进行统一清除，而 delta rule 则对某个特定关联进行定向编辑。这种分工十分有效，但其中两个门控在每个注意力头内都仍然只是标量</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u44166126" id="u44166126" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnI-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tk_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5CnS_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tv_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F864b7fb80d34c3c95e83f15f5dce857e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QyKWe%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4acc3f5c" id="u4acc3f5c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3a2d3ac" id="ua3a2d3ac">KDA 从 decay 一侧进一步改进这一机制，将标量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1325bda5b65a22f8e7f7cf72684946e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lgyb8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub81226c1" id="ub81226c1">替换为逐通道向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20(0%2C1%5D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce6c71e6350d5dce624ca924595d883c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OlUHS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b5a0862" id="u2b5a0862">。定义</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1f8c26a6736f0e001b45166ca56d310.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bBpaG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u506558e5" id="u506558e5">，则其更新可以写为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3477d273" id="u3477d273" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnI-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_tk_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5CnD_tS_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tv_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a6824831273f036db34fcafc2e9d0b5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kuD14%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua5613c5d"><li fid="uf75247f3" data-lake-id="u44128ae4" id="u44128ae4"><span data-lake-id="u3bdc5352" id="u3bdc5352">KDA 允许每一个 key 通道按照各自独立的速率进行衰减，同时保留 DeltaNet 中基于 WY 表示的高效 chunkwise 算法</span></li><li fid="uf75247f3" data-lake-id="ubbd9e125" id="ubbd9e125"><strong><span data-lake-id="u30d83b04" id="u30d83b04" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，主动门控</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5461c39cccf1b607eb60af7bed2ef8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d7TGR%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u31a0fd84" id="u31a0fd84" style="color: #DF2A3F">仍然只是一个标量。它同时控制两件事情：从当前读取方向中擦除多少旧内容，以及写入多少新的 value 信息</span></strong></li><li fid="uf75247f3" data-lake-id="u83a133a4" id="u83a133a4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bca61c4" id="u2bca61c4" style="color: #00346B">Gated DeltaNet-2 正是从这一尚未解除的耦合关系出发，对其进一步进行改进</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="NlXQE" id="NlXQE" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4ad60126" id="u4ad60126">🐿️</span><span data-lake-id="ua24d5058" id="ua24d5058"> 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐬𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐰𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u260cdd4b" id="u260cdd4b"><span data-lake-id="u2a45d848" id="u2a45d848">KDA 通过将衰减扩展为逐通道形式改进 Gated DeltaNet，但式（7）中的标量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65ab8e5bfbba1d104086d7970722ee6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L5h3L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35d750be" id="u35d750be">仍然同时承担着两项未必一致的决策</span></p><ul list="ub2ed7cd7"><li fid="u33dff09f" data-lake-id="u11a226d1" id="u11a226d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1111c4b9" id="u1111c4b9" style="color: #101E60">一项决策位于键侧，决定当前读取内容中的哪些坐标应被擦除；另一项决策位于值侧，决定候选值中的哪些坐标应被写入。将这两项决策统一为一个标量，是对更新形式的限制，而非 Delta 规则本身的要求</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udf27781f" id="udf27781f"><span data-lake-id="u831ec484" id="u831ec484">Gated DeltaNet-2 通过 </span><em><span data-lake-id="u06c990f3" id="u06c990f3">Gated Delta Rule-2</span></em><span data-lake-id="udb64c05e" id="udb64c05e"> 将这两项决策分离。令</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6cbd6f08" id="u6cbd6f08" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_t%3Db_t%5C%5Codot%20k_t%2C%5C%5Cquad%20z_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%5C%5Codot%20v_t.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5221a09988d79e37c210e6cdb4140f03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zNaUW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u86467404"><li fid="u3d574481" data-lake-id="u0b6ddb7b" id="u0b6ddb7b"><span data-lake-id="u5396bca7" id="u5396bca7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6e6bb56eefee63a2baa75c1fb413a0ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vJuCU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub34227cb" id="ub34227cb">为擦除门，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9845588a6d0c9e1890c6132e09985911.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OnMhD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b3ba98c" id="u0b3ba98c">为写入门。擦除门对用于读取旧内容的键坐标进行加权，而写入门对待插入的值坐标进行加权。令 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D_t%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd03948675cfe1928bda6298b04b9dfd9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IBdDC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb2c7c0c" id="ucb2c7c0c">。先施加衰减，再执行当前的编辑操作，得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5befd2d4" id="u5befd2d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20r_t%3D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7De_t%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%2Bk_t(z_t-r_t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37786d0b2c3ee3d921e3f523ddef4e47.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BxfD2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua470cc25" id="ua470cc25" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D-k_t(b_t%5C%5Codot%20k_t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bk_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%5C%5Codot%20v_t)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F893b31d82a3541d5ddb4425b87cecbc1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bTKzE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u27fa7dd5"><li fid="ub1cf193b" data-lake-id="ubdb175f4" id="ubdb175f4"><span data-lake-id="u46be01b0" id="u46be01b0">将式（10）称为 </span><em><span data-lake-id="u4133bcf8" id="u4133bcf8">Gated Delta Rule-2</span></em><span data-lake-id="u156b8c59" id="u156b8c59">。输出为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dq_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c558c3458f2547ed64147d1d9c3769f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TbLSb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16ed649d" id="u16ed649d">。擦除矩阵的左因子仍为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b088a8bc36a53af961a3c97d8052bf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T9LzU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube501319" id="ube501319">，从而保留 Delta 规则的写入方向。右因子变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_t%5C%5Codot%20k_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2714e593a7f4937c7693315a5c9f13c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sfh5h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f6650a1" id="u5f6650a1">，使读取方向具有通道选择性。写入项变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k_tz_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2c526b4bc0bd6a239bd80af227c4a06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DnA6g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc61df64d" id="uc61df64d">，使值更新具有通道选择性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u76625547" id="u76625547"><strong><span data-lake-id="u074e6989" id="u074e6989">当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_t%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58446a8b18f2787ae3226dffa42c0a3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rsgC8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub65db855" id="ub65db855">且</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F80282fedb91929e8e6f5bd21da0c4e6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VVd4m%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1ab3b82" id="ua1ab3b82">时，Gated Delta Rule-2 精确退化为 KDA。进一步令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1bb984bf05b360363c8487230d10065c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ouBTQ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u96de37e7" id="u96de37e7">，则退化为 Gated DeltaNet。因此，该模型将已有的标量门控更新保留为参数绑定的子空间，同时允许在擦除与写入需要不同通道结构时，在这些子空间之外进行学习</span></strong></p><ul list="udc5bfb42"><li fid="u938cf8b8" data-lake-id="u874aeaa1" id="u874aeaa1"><span data-lake-id="u528b18bf" id="u528b18bf">该层通过对词元表示进行独立投影，生成两个门</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u21b00233" id="u21b00233" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_t%3D%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_b%20x_t)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%3D%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_w%20x_t).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c9c6c3e96df9275bd47223b1fd6c8fb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nea44%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5805df43"><li fid="uabd84de1" data-lake-id="u4788c144" id="u4788c144"><span data-lake-id="u9e934091" id="u9e934091">对数衰减沿用 Gated DeltaNet 的参数化形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1556f653" id="u1556f653" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_t%3D-%5C%5Cexp(a)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftplus%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_f%20x_t%2B%5C%5Cdelta)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cexp(g_t).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa278902338ad82a51af70912b25c4b22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PjBeN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufb040438"><li fid="u4548f050" data-lake-id="u3e3f6ebd" id="u3e3f6ebd"><span data-lake-id="u0863ecf9" id="u0863ecf9">在实际实现中，该衰减激活在传入计算内核之前以 FP32 精度计算，从而避免累积对数衰减中的精度损失</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="rw7Z1" id="rw7Z1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u963d23b5" id="u963d23b5">🐹</span><span data-lake-id="u782dcc02" id="u782dcc02"> 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭-𝐰𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭 𝐮𝐩𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud0851db3" id="ud0851db3"><strong><span data-lake-id="uee7e15de" id="uee7e15de">将 Gated Delta Rule-2 解释为对快权重记忆状态的在线更新。状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ddcb1c3e3bebedd840762bed927b84f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d59Cd%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f7b7180" id="u1f7b7180">存储短暂的键值关联。对于每个词元，模型首先构造衰减后的状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1f7dc32bbcfa286a06ebdbb19e7d887.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R05Ey%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u30ee89b4" id="u30ee89b4">，随后沿门控擦除方向</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe079b43cd41c198baa7602a3c1de4ccc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Iwhvm%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c83a251" id="u4c83a251">读取旧内容，并写入朝向门控值目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb950546bfda135690bb185f35b23b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zxc2b%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe50b9f4" id="ufe50b9f4">的修正量。更形式化地，式（9）是以下局部在线优化问题的解</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue2d3f69c" id="ue2d3f69c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cunderset%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5C%2CL_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20L_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2-2%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dk_t%2C%5C%5C%20z_t-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7De_t%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3aa29774a098c01ce58c4baaaea6cd06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P6Cze%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3564013f"><li fid="u52155836" data-lake-id="u8eed0e62" id="u8eed0e62"><span data-lake-id="u99485fd7" id="u99485fd7">第一项使新状态保持接近衰减后的记忆。第二项施加关联编辑，其残差比较门控写入目标</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb950546bfda135690bb185f35b23b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i0QXE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubde2003f" id="ubde2003f">与沿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe079b43cd41c198baa7602a3c1de4ccc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JRNnV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u569ecc69" id="u569ecc69">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7e202f7b14b18cfad6b63d058a4a3bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zI3iM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac23f7af" id="uac23f7af">中读取的内容。由于</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5e714fdf" id="u5e714fdf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7DL_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%3D2%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5C%5Cright)-2k_t%5C%5Cleft(z_t-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7De_t%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36eacda0e33018240cf684733585c63f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uKJSN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0064d756"><li fid="u158428c4" data-lake-id="udce98437" id="udce98437"><span data-lake-id="ud069b01c" id="ud069b01c">使目标函数取得最小值的解为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucb4fcdd1" id="ucb4fcdd1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%2Bk_t%5C%5Cleft(z_t-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7De_t%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd098aaf9cfa2d3a63d25dced5e71d555.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tCmaQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1f0d283f" id="u1f0d283f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790398273890-cc465fa4-22bf-4eba-b601-52f65aba8f8d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4e330019-b2e9-4331-8d80-08be44c78d9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u710afaeb-a328-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A750%2C%22height%22%3A338%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A139015%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1400%2C%22originHeight%22%3A631%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2(STKI%2CB(UR-(DST-1)TKT)%22%2C%22x%22%3A203%2C%22y%22%3A358%2C%22width%22%3A384%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2(S1KT%2CBRUR-SIKI%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A318%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222(S1KI%2CZ-(DISI-1)ET%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A577%2C%22width%22%3A306%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2(S1K-1%2CNU1-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A241%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222(SKT%2C3I(U-(AISI-I)1KI)%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A363%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AI(I-BKK)ST_1%22%2C%22x%22%3A890%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2STK%2CGIUI%22%2C%22x%22%3A208%2C%22y%22%3A489%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S-AS-G%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S-DS-L%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A534%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S-AS-LI%22%2C%22x%22%3A203%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B1%B1S-AS-LI%22%2C%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222SKT%2CUI%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3D(1-BKKI)ST-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A847%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%3D(I-KE)DTST-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A846%2C%22y%22%3A537%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GATEDDELTANET1L%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-AIST-1%E5%8D%81KIUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A852%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OCALOBJECTIVELT(S%22%2C%22x%22%3A216%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S-DS-LL%22%2C%22x%22%3A202%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A288%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-I-BKKDIST%22%2C%22x%22%3A880%2C%22y%22%3A324%2C%22width%22%3A223%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%E4%BA%8CATST_1%E5%8D%81T8T_%22%2C%22x%22%3A867%2C%22y%22%3A412%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2BBIKU%22%2C%22x%22%3A882%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GATEDDELTANET-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S-S-LA%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAMBA-3%5B13%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ELTANETIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STATEUPDATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A853%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAMBA-2%5B8%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81B%3AK%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A899%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KDA12%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A323%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81BIK0%22%2C%22x%22%3A894%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81K%22%2C%22x%22%3A903%2C%22y%22%3A579%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLETHO%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%815IKTU%22%2C%22x%22%3A902%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafaf9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u536f9028%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue485b609" id="ue485b609"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b0a1fc3" id="u3b0a1fc3">对于表中的 Mamba-3 一行，采用 SISO 指数—梯形递推。令</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u77b41d13" id="u77b41d13" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7Bk%7D_s%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_%7B1%3As%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dk_s%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Ceta_t%3D(1-%5C%5Clambda_t)%5C%5CDelta_t%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Czeta_t%3D%5C%5Clambda_t%5C%5CDelta_t.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6f30930a233588095bd109128ca074e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QwHHj%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1021489d"><li fid="ue8604d58" data-lake-id="uca5b8319" id="uca5b8319"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_%7B1%3As%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbe36a6f92a84b338abbc3e5684fc642.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dee2u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e3e9467" id="u3e3e9467">是复数 SSM 视角下依赖数据的累积旋转，且在序列起始处省略前一词元对应的项。MIMO 版本将每次秩一写入替换为沿 MIMO 秩维度的求和，同时保持相同的在线形式不变</span></li><li fid="ue8604d58" data-lake-id="ud830e2b7" id="ud830e2b7"><span data-lake-id="u260def36" id="u260def36">Mamba-3 通过指数—梯形输入规则和依赖数据的旋转增强这种写入的表达能力，但不会从状态中减去当前读取的内容</span></li><li fid="ue8604d58" data-lake-id="u5047febf" id="u5047febf"><span data-lake-id="uc7135cfc" id="uc7135cfc">Gated DeltaNet 和 KDA 则执行残差式 Delta 编辑。KDA 将衰减由标量形式改为逐通道形式，同时保留标量门控的残差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t(v_t-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dk_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa65058c92331bf6f6ce38241e305f52a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SamjS%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ue8604d58" data-lake-id="ub572b4bc" id="ub572b4bc"><span data-lake-id="u91d7ab6a" id="u91d7ab6a">Gated DeltaNet-2 则将残差本身改为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_t-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7De_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%5C%5Codot%20v_t-%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BD%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D(b_t%5C%5Codot%20k_t)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4383ada081e01260194229e8b5898523.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fhuew%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d126f3d" id="u9d126f3d">从而将用于擦除的坐标与用于写入的坐标解耦</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="BAzAZ" id="BAzAZ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue6d873ad" id="ue6d873ad">🐙</span><span data-lake-id="u98bc1eec" id="u98bc1eec"> 𝐂𝐡𝐮𝐧𝐤𝐰𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥 𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua813e7d9" id="ua813e7d9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2ae6cbc" id="ua2ae6cbc">Gated Delta Rule-2 保留与 KDA 相同的分块结构。考虑一个块，并省略块索引。令</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud45b58a8" id="ud45b58a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G_r%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dg_i%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_r%3D%5C%5Cexp(G_r)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_0%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_%7Bd_k%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F415f1e74c459ec93d937548e48796672.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NOFwB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u02240c07"><li fid="u481927af" data-lake-id="ua93f619d" id="ua93f619d"><span data-lake-id="u200ba3a3" id="u200ba3a3">通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_r%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_r)%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0cd524c212d67f9ff54853df3f0b6c3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zKx1x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93322a1a" id="u93322a1a">定义衰减归一化状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327fcc6e7b3faa926d138498f01b5028.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uAInd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84e8d85b" id="u84e8d85b">。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_0%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43c8ac1bc19d5bb327918fe75cb80894.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RiE3R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63f0b3ed" id="u63f0b3ed">，式（10）变为纯粹的非对称 Delta 递推，这种归一化是实现高效计算形式的关键。逐通道衰减被吸收到每个秩一擦除项的两个因子中，而更新仍保持为形如</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7Bk%7D_r%5C%5Cbar%7Be%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5db15f39006b78781673df150083b8eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D5Mmt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d0426c9" id="u3d0426c9">的矩阵之积。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d4f42b6" id="u6d4f42b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_r%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7Bk%7D_r%5C%5Cbar%7Be%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Br-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cbar%7Bk%7D_rz_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7Bk%7D_r%3D%5C%5Cgamma_r%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Codot%20k_r%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7Be%7D_r%3D%5C%5Cgamma_r%5C%5Codot%20e_r.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb7b4f09fa67743852179ea1ebf9c4c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oYadg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2836a96f" id="u2836a96f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f9718b5" id="u9f9718b5">令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6631d390ee858ee2efb15edff66d3222.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CDUsU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd295c69" id="ubd295c69">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe00582973694f8565ba6804f8a5c512a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KcZg3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueba7d34e" id="ueba7d34e">的各行分别为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7afd42cec5f11d04e9f4e7d7be85e4bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D1bKk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u218f62aa" id="u218f62aa">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F391a90010bc2e5decd4ab64f998ad739.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n1eJl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaed2f324" id="uaed2f324">。为使矩阵表示更加紧凑，令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0303149ccb0bb72a6453b39f14fa01ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G6pgM%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9465df2" id="ud9465df2">的各行为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6bcd8b2c44db560686701cabcd3e4f0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gZFAF%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e4e5d12" id="u3e4e5d12">。令</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c0188548d023bbe2d587d58f411533f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vUhz8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucad8ed59" id="ucad8ed59">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd492fc8eca6beb8db84eb268d58c3637.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cqn3l%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b599ef3" id="u6b599ef3"> 和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2565d3ce63c12b573ccf8d0ad82da2ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zf7d9%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u28860136" id="u28860136">的各行分别为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bk%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5cf893f42e1459c649aeb2dc313ade9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22caqS0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1faaadaf" id="u1faaadaf">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Be%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8953f968eaf0d5ef5f269e6845590bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JfIBl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5507c9fb" id="u5507c9fb">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5c7c677eec8d53064f59e30c8c3d9ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5YQQ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u68c63914" id="u68c63914">。等价地</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua781fa02" id="ua781fa02" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Codot(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc820d2911f75581be824887a09df5c70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tgo5p%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9d9e3e84" id="u9d9e3e84" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btril%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C-1%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2588e42ada4e20c5c9b3c2abb1d2d5e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hotxU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uad5a97c3" id="uad5a97c3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02390348c6f1735112f528625671170f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZIcUk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub8b5c8d6"><li fid="u5ce4641b" data-lake-id="uc5cd26e3" id="uc5cd26e3"><span data-lake-id="uad794c22" id="uad794c22">这里，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae47b6c30c0ee3a803c33b678586db9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nuN3e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70e97ff9" id="u70e97ff9">是擦除侧辅助量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30011afc3637d2a234615017c10f0bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ljy9M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8eb57a1c" id="u8eb57a1c">是写入侧辅助量。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dee3c9215c220e1c053e4b2e5cefe2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZXlX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucba355c0" id="ucba355c0">是对角元为零的三角矩阵，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc915ec068f4cf626130b57bbf8f7ab65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJkfc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc9b7f67" id="udc9b7f67">可通过每个块内的小规模前向代入求得。于是，块末状态为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1d63440a" id="u1d63440a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%2B1%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_C)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btail%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a7762ae6107f5dbc6891b143ade1a22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XPfFd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7ad392c8"><li fid="ub39605b5" data-lake-id="uad3da225" id="uad3da225"><span data-lake-id="u01f599ed" id="u01f599ed">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btail%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e3edee13614311d5b21131bbb52ce1f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CDgIM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc1d545b" id="udc1d545b">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22frWM2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e9a5f90" id="u1e9a5f90">行为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cgamma_C%2F%5C%5Cgamma_r)%5C%5Codot%20k_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb32585607a538e703f4f77a74b83cb18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i4Vxq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21752600" id="u21752600">。输出块为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufc829837" id="ufc829837" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D_%7Bqk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bn%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89ddfe9def1f8beff1626fd4f92cdea4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AE9Qd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub3cfd955"><li fid="u5c2ae5f5" data-lake-id="u6b285355" id="u6b285355"><span data-lake-id="u8e12ee59" id="u8e12ee59">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc19eb9e07ee0f30f785ff6778b43fb6a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kmdsk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91407caf" id="u91407caf">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3vGe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef0dc7ce" id="uef0dc7ce">行为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_r%5C%5Codot%20q_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a1abd0b76bdca0f2998cc99e6361f84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O2sRY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2dbee91e" id="u2dbee91e">，并且</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4ad0224" id="uf4ad0224" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D_%7Bqk%7D)_%7Brs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_%7Br%5C%5Cge%20s%7D%5C%5C%2Cq_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_r%2F%5C%5Cgamma_s)k_s.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb21f7e798865e8f8451f7311af124a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jrIQR%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue6926157"><li fid="u77170d51" data-lake-id="u0e6bc4df" id="u0e6bc4df"><span data-lake-id="ua9cfd777" id="ua9cfd777">擦除门通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1e3c9bf2977f3b78692f923ff5f33cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZTi2S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55377f2e" id="u55377f2e">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GGZ5w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28248fae" id="u28248fae">行以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_r%5C%5Codot(b_r%5C%5Codot%20k_r)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc62b1886ff398668fb8b58a8fe84ef65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FE2Za%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6337b46" id="ue6337b46">的形式引入。写入门通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d06f8e675646c1e1564fed2133dafde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Klw7V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufeb38ef4" id="ufeb38ef4">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T45BM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85b4c2cf" id="u85b4c2cf">行以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_r%5C%5Codot%20v_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9cdee87b150fecee94cc7f582c8bbefa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x7Lwr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39ae8f28" id="u39ae8f28">的形式引入。其余计算是在固定大小的块上进行三角求解和稠密矩阵乘法。采用 WY 变换，并使用融合的 Triton 内核实现这些方程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u04b6fbc6" id="u04b6fbc6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790399204804-1c7d27f2-2798-4a24-915b-1c33dd3aa90c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uec673851-2cb4-458a-b5ea-77f20e48975%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7ff6fff6-4603-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A859.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A377%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87160%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1217%2C%22originHeight%22%3A534%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A595%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A204%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HYBRIDGATEDDELTANNET-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A508%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GATEDDELTARULE-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A744%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GATEDDELTANET-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A378%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKDESIGN%22%2C%22x%22%3A787%2C%22y%22%3A507%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SWA%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A1091%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A793%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A800%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A260%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A169%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A611%2C%22y%22%3A354%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A53%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1049%2C%22y%22%3A337%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A53%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bed0c1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1d406625%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u792dbfa2" id="u792dbfa2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d8cd584" id="u8d8cd584">反向传播采用与前向传播相同的分解方式。梯度首先流经输出方程和块间状态递推，两者都仅涉及</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D_%7Bqk%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc491cf277c92be0dcb9bad0f2206d31e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QpzDL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc42b7fb8" id="uc42b7fb8">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btail%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e3edee13614311d5b21131bbb52ce1f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jxZw8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uba805e1c" id="uba805e1c">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae47b6c30c0ee3a803c33b678586db9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ph3Tq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u36adcec0" id="u36adcec0">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30011afc3637d2a234615017c10f0bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n5FbB%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7473eb0" id="ud7473eb0">。唯一新增的梯度计算是通过式（22）和式（21）的向量—雅可比积</span></strong></p><ul list="u79c165df"><li fid="u54021e68" data-lake-id="ud6ff7fb0" id="ud6ff7fb0"><span data-lake-id="u344c4967" id="u344c4967">写入侧在值通道上包含一个对角门控，而擦除侧在键通道上包含另一个不同的对角门控。因此，门控因子必须保留在梯度累积的位置。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdec3402256da96f7b674b4bf08101ca2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oeoVj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba02c0b6" id="uba02c0b6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc10020247da5f8307363dbc8d72fdc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WnuAo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73f8fb21" id="u73f8fb21">的各行分别为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7afd42cec5f11d04e9f4e7d7be85e4bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyEtd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5788cd74" id="u5788cd74">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_r%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F391a90010bc2e5decd4ab64f998ad739.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Utyug%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uddcf7b15" id="uddcf7b15">，并令 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i0gGQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8454034" id="ud8454034"> 表示将累积衰减向量按行堆叠得到的矩阵。则</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u87c5994b" id="u87c5994b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5C%5Cmathrel%7B%2B%3D%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B26%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4cb93a9e4c41c10e714c3701a0decb8b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PKAt2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufe466a2e" id="ufe466a2e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5C%5Cmathrel%7B%2B%3D%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Codot(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B27%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f0e0c37c6960e1e44d8a2a16bc8a391.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hXvxu%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2e0cdb20"><li fid="u64291ede" data-lake-id="u7de0ade2" id="u7de0ade2"><span data-lake-id="u813ed344" id="u813ed344">求逆操作本身具有标准的三角矩阵向量—雅可比积：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub9829391" id="ub9829391" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D%3D-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btril%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C-1%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B28%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb20fd873624d596f7da5301eee3b5793.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22doUWs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5e64cb57"><li fid="ubd7b0b56" data-lake-id="u559c6a1b" id="u559c6a1b"><span data-lake-id="u23ccbc10" id="u23ccbc10">在此基础上，通过常规的逐元素乘积和反向累积求和，即可得到关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BB%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdec3402256da96f7b674b4bf08101ca2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vbxeH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06b5403a" id="u06b5403a">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc10020247da5f8307363dbc8d72fdc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PVbu0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57dfa88f" id="u57dfa88f">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbd2339328b7567cf8beb0c5239de4f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pTtbM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a380eac" id="u5a380eac">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bec24d5f866144b9e8b022cc76d75fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MU4ia%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u829c456a" id="u829c456a">以及累积衰减的梯度。这种门控感知的梯度累积，是训练 Gated Delta Rule-2 所需的主要数学改动。其余反向传播内核保持与 KDA 相同的矩阵形状，并可复用相同的状态与输出向量—雅可比积结构<br /><br /></span></li></ul>